  <para style="h">Johane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndebo Mbuya Ngekwa JOHANE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Johane</para>
  <para style="toc3">Joh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndebo Mbuya Sekwayakakwagwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">ndiJOHANE</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ndebo Mbuya sekwayakakwagwa ndiJohane</char> gumwe lukwalo gwewhalo dzilina dzeThesitamente Ndzwa dzinoleba nekwebutjilo gwaYesu. Gumwe negumwe lukwalo goyi “ndebo mbuya.” Whalo idzedzi dzakakwagwa naMatewu, naMako, naLuka naJohane hule kwefa kwaYesu. Ndebo Mbuya sekwayakakwagwa ndiJohane ingabe yakakwagwa neMpositoli Johane mumakole angaba makumi ahhanalume hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu. Nekene lukwalo igogu gusingalebe kuti Johane ndiye nkwali, kwala koyendidzana newhalo dzaJohane wekutanga, naJohane webubili naJohane webutatu. Bamwe bakwali bantolo banoti Johane waka egala munzi-nkulu weku Efesu mulubaka igogu ndizo lukwalo igogu gungabe gwakakwaligwa muEfesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ndebo Mbuya sekwayakakwagwa ndiJohane</char> inoleba kupatjena nekwe tjinangwa tjelukwalo kudze gutjidze banhu bagalemoyo kuti Yesu ndiye Khirisitu, Nkololo weNdzimu unotjila (Joh 20.31). Nekuti ngekugalamoyo ikoku tingabe nebutjilo muzina lile. Lukwalo gwakakwaligwa banobala bemaJuta nebasi BaJuta. Ndebo mbuya yaJohane mudzimwe zila yakasiyana nedzimwe whalo nhatu. Wakakwala akalingisana nezwilakidzilo zwakayetiwa naYesu azokwala kwazo nekwe zwifananidzo zwizwe. Kumwe kwezwinhu zwakayetikala kunonga bvubikiwa kwaYesu nelikwa mutjilambanyika akuzokwagwa mundebo mbuya iyeyi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Johane unotangisa ndebo mbuya mudanho 1.1-18.</para>
  <para style="io1">Unokwala kakale nekwezwimwe zwilakidzilo zwinjinji zwakayetiwa naYesu (Joh 1.19-12.50)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unolongolosa kakale nekwezwimwe zwinhu zwakayetikala mubutjilo gwaYesu zwakathama kuti afe kakale amuke (Joh 13.1-20.31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Johane unopedzisa ndebo mbuya mudanho 21 eleba nekwelubaka gumwe Yesu kwaakazwilakidza kubanhu hule kwekumuka kukwe kubafi ekotjileba nekwe tjinangwa tjekwala kukwe lukwalo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Dama LeButjilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Kutanga kwakabe kuna Dama, Dama lakabe lina Ndzimu kakale Dama lakabe lili Ndzimu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Dama lakabe lina Ndzimu kutanga, <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />zwinhu zose zwakayetiwa ndiye, asipo iye akuna tjinhu tjin'ompela tjiyapo tjakayetiwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Muwunli kwaka kuna butjilo, kakale butjilo igogo gwaka guli tjedza tjebanhu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Tjedza tjovoneka muhhalima, hhalima alizotjikunda.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Waka alipo umwe nlume wakatumwa neNdzimu, zina lile laka liyi Johane. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Wakahha alinsupi, kuti asenge busupi gwetjedza, kuti nentha iye banhu bose bagalemoyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Iye tjekukwe waka asi tjedza, koga wakahhila kuti awhopa busupi nekwetjedza. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Nditjo itjetjo tjedza tjemalebeswa tjinovonekela nhu wose tjakatjihha muhango.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Waka ali muhango, nehango yakayetiwa ndiye, koga hango ayizowunziba. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Wakahha kuhango yakanyi kukwe, koga banhu bakanyi kukwe abazowuwamutjila. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Koga ibabo bose bakawuwamutjila, ibo bakagalamoyo muzina lile, wakabapa masimba ekuti babe bana beNdzimu, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />bakazwagwa, kusi kwelopa, kene ngekuda kwenyama kene ngekuda kwenhu, koga ngekuda kweNdzimu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Dama lakabe nhu akagala pakati kwedu, alihhele mawhilangoni nelebeswa, takalinga tikabona gudzo lile, gudzo leNkololo iye yega waTate.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Johane wakapa busupi nekukwe, akadanilila eti, “Whoyu ndiye wandakaleba nekukwe nditi, ‘Iye unohha hule kwangu unkulu pandili, nekuti waka alipo imi ndisanhu ndabepo.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kubva mubuhhalo gugwe tose takawamutjila, ngoni pehhugwi kwedzimwe ngoni. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ngobe nlayo wakapiwa ndiMozisi, koga ngoni nelebeswa kwakahha naYesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Akuna nhu wakatongobona Ndzimu, Nkololo uyega, iye Ndzimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ndzimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dzimwe whalo whulukugwi dzoti Nkololo</char></note> tjekukwe upamoyo waTate, ndiye wakathama bakazibgwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama aJohane Mbvubiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matewu 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Igogu ndigo busupi gwaJohane, maJuta pabakatuma baphirisiti nebaLevi bebva kuJerusalema kuti bawhowumbhuzwa beti, “Ndiwe yani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Wakabvuma, haazotongolamba, koga wakaleba eti, “Imi andita iye Khirisitu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bakawumbhuzwa beti, “Ngono ndiwe yani? Ndiwe Elija?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wakati, “Andita iye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ndiwe nlebesambeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Wakahandula eti, “Aa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Bakakotjiti kuwunli, “Ndiwe yani? Utipe n'handulo yatinowhonopa batituma. Notini nekuko?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Wakati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Imi ndiwhi lewunodanilila ali mutjilambanyika eti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Baakanyani zila yaHe,’ sekwakalebgwa nenlebesambeli Isaya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ibabo bakabatumwa nebaFarisi, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />bakawumbhuzwa beti, “Ngono unobvubikilani banhu, hapa usi Khirisitu, kene Elija, kene nlebesambeli?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Johane wakabahandula eti, “Imi ndomubvubika muvula, koga pakati kwenyu kuna umwe wamusingazibe, <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />iye unohha hule kwangu, mitjili yehangu dzidze imi andizolizanila kuti ndiyisunungule.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Kose ikoku kwakayetika kuBhethani seli yaJorodani, paka pebvubikila Johane.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhwizana yeNdzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Hhuba linotobela Johane wakabona Yesu ehha kuwunli, akati, “Lingani, Mhwizana yeNdzimu, inodusa matjinyo ehango! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ndiye iwhoyu wandaka ndileba nekukwe nditi, ‘Kuna umwe nlume unohha hule kwangu koga unkulu pandili, nekuti waka alipo imi ndisanhu ndabepo.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Imi ndaka ndisingawunzibe, koga nentha yayikoku ndakahha ndibvubika banhu nevula, kuti iye alakidziwe kuna Isirayeli.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Johane wakapa busupi, eti, “Ndakabona Meya Yakayengemala ijetuka senjiba ibva kudzimu, ikagala pehhugwi kukwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Imi ndaka ndisingawunzibe, koga iye wakandituma kuti ndibvubike banhu nevula wakati kundili, ‘Iwhoyo wawunowhobona Meya ijetukila pehhugwi kukwe ikagala pawunli, ndiye iwhoyo unowhobvubika banhu ngeMeya Yakayengemala.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ndabona kakale ndikapa busupi gwekuti iwhoyu ndiye Nkololo weNdzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Badiyiwa baYesu Bekutanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Hhuba linotobela kakale Johane waka alimile nebadiyiwa babe babili; <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />akalinga Yesu paaka enangayilazwe, akati, “Lingani Mhwizana yeNdzimu!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Badiyiwa babili pabakawuwha eleba ikoku, bakatobela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu wakatjebuka, akabona bewuntobela, akati kubali, “Mohakani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bakati kuwunli, “Rabhi” (Kubva kuti Ndhiyi), “Mogala poni?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Iye wakati kubali, “Buyani mowhobona.” Bakahha bakabona paaka egala; bakahwa naye hhuba ilelo, ngobe hhuba laka latewuka kwatjibe awa yebuna masikati.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Umwe webabili wakawha Johane elebeleka, akatobela Yesu, waka ali Andhireya, nun'una waSimoni Phethiro. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Wakatanga ahaka nkulu uwe Simoni, akati kuwunli, “Tawuwana Mesiya” (Kubva kuti Khirisitu). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Wakawuhhisa kunaYesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu wakawunlinga akati, “Zina lilo ndiSimoni nkololo waJohane, koga unowhodan'wa Khefasi” (kunobva kuti Phethiro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phethiro </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nange tjiGiriki kunofanana nekuti Khefasi netjiAramayiki, kubva kuti “hongwe” </char></note>).<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu unodana Filiphi naNathaniyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Tjimuka Yesu wakakumbula yenda kuGalile. Wakawana Filiphi akati kuwunli, “Unditobele.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filiphi waka ebva kuBhethisayida, nzi-nkulu kwaka kubva Andhireya naPhethiro. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filiphi wakawana Nathaniyeli, akati kuwunli, “Tawuwana wakakwagwa nekukwe naMozisi munlayo, nebalebesambeli bakakwala nekukwe, Yesu wekuNazaretha, nkololo waJosefa.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nathaniyeli wakati kuwunli, “Kuna tjinhu tjibuya tjingabhuda kuNazaretha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filiphi wakati kuwunli, “Buya uwhobona.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu paakabona Nathaniyeli ehha kuwunli, wakati nekukwe, “Linga, nhu weku Isirayeli wakwako, usina tjengela muwunli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nathaniyeli wakati kuwunli, “Mandiziba tjini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Filiphi asanhu akudana, uli kusi kwenkuyu, ndakubona.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Nathaniyeli wakawun'handula eti, “Rabhi, Munkololo weNdzimu! Ndimwi Mambo waIsirayeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Nekuti ndati kukuli ndakubona uli kusi kwenkuyu, wagalamoyo? Unowhobona zwinhu zwikulu kupinda izwezwi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Eba eti kuwunli, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, mowhobona kudzimu kuhhuka, nebatumwa beNdzimu betanha pehhugwi nedelukila pasi kweNkololo weNhu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Nzano webukwe paKana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Muhhuba lebutatu kwaka kunanzano webukwe kuKana muGalile, mayi baYesu baka baliko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />naYesu bo waka akokewa kunzano webukwe, kose nebadiyiwa babe bo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Wayini yakati yapela, mayi baYesu bakati kuwunli, “Abatjina wayini.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Aa aa! mme, Ngono kuneni nami? Lubaka gwangu agwanhu gwaswika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Meyabe bakati kubalanda, “Muthame tjimwe netjimwe tjaanobe amubudza itjo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Kwaka kuna hali dzemabgwe dzitanhatu dzaka dzakabigwa ipapo, dzinohingisiwa panlenje wemaJuta wetjenesewa, imwe neyimwe yadzo yaka ingina malitha angaba makumi ali hhanakadzi kunoti malitha aligulu lina makumi mabili. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu wakati kubalanda, “Hhadzani hali idzedzi nevula.” Bakadzihhadza dzikati tupu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Akakotjiti kubali, “Tjitjelani imwe, mundopa mbhati wenzano.” Bakayeta bejalo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mbhati wenzano wakati alabila vula yakayayetiwa ikabe wayini, akasaziba kuti wayini iyeyo inobva poni (nekutobe balanda ibo bakayitjela bakabeziba), mbhati wenzano wakadana nkwaha <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akati kuwunli, “Umwe newumwe nhu unopa banhu wayini inozipa kutanga, kukotjiti hapa banhu ban'wa batjilaladza, kukotjihha inoyipa; koga iwe watjengeta wayini inozipa kukadza kukabe ngwenuwali.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yeli ndilo jenamiso lekutanga lakayetiwa naYesu kuKana muGalile elakidza gudzo lile, badiyiwa babe bakagalamoyo muwunli.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Hule kwayikoku wakajetukila kuKhaphenawume, nameyabe nebanun'una babe nebadiyiwa babe, bakanogala ko kwemahhuba mahomanana.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unoyenda kuThempeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12">Matewu 21.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mako 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luka 19.45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Phasika yemaJuta yaka yabe pedlo, ndizo Yesu wakayenda kuJerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Muthempeli wakawana baka betengesa n'ombe, nemhwizi, newhukutiba, nebaka betengesa mari beligele beyendilambeli nen'hingo wabo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Eluka tjimi tjemitjili, wakabadusa bose, kose nemhwizi nen'ombe, muthempeli, akapitula mathebuli ebanotengesa mari etebulila pasi maloso abo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Wakabudza baka betengesa whukutiba eti, “Dusilani zwinhu izwezwi kutjena; musithame n'umba yaTate bangu kuti ibe n'umba yeyingidzila.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Badiyiwa babe bakakumbula kuti kwakakwagwa kuti, “Bilayilila n'umba yenyu kowhondidla moyo kwazo.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />MaJuta akakoti kuwunli, “Nditjipi tjilakidzilo tjawungathama tjinolayidza kuti unamasimba ethama ikoku?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Kolomolani thempeli ileli, mumahhuba matatu ndowholimusa kakale.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />MaJuta akati kuwunli, “Kwakatola makole makumi mana ana kutanhatu kuti thempeli ileli lipele bakiwa, ngono iwe unoti unowholibaka mumahhuba matatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Koga thempeli laaka eleba nekwalo umbili uwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Wakakotjiti amusiwa kubafi, badiyiwa babe bakakumbula kuti waka akuleba ikoku, bakagalamoyo mulukwalo nedama lakalalebgwa naYesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luzibo gwaYesu nekweBanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Wakati ali muJerusalema panzano wePhasika, banjinji bakagalamoyo muzina lile bebona zwilakidzilo zwaaka ethama, <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />koga Yesu haazozwipila kubali, ngobe waka eziba kuti banhu bose batjini, <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />kakale kuwunli kwakakusingahakike kuti kube nenhu unopa busupi nekwebanhu; ngobe iye tjekukwe waka eziba kuti ini tjimunhu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu naNikodimasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Sangwenu kwaka kuna umwe nlumetate waka elimFarisi, waka eyi Nikodimasi, ali umwe webatungamili bemaJuta. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Nlume iwhoyu wakahha kuna Yesu busiku akati kuwunli, “Rabhi, toziba kuti mundhiyi unobva kuNdzimu, ngobe akuna nhu ungathama zwilakidzilo izwezwi zwamunothama, kuhhe kwekuti Ndzimu abe anaye.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kukuli, kuhhe kwekuti nhu azwagwe butshwa, aangabone bumambo gweNdzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodimasi wakati kuwunli, “Nhu ungazwagwa butshwa tjini iye atjikula? Angangina gwebubili muntumbu wameyabe akakozwagwa kakale?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa ndoti kukuli, kuhhe kwekuti nhu azwagwe nevula nangeMeya, aangangine mubumambo gweNdzimu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Tjinozwagwa nenyama inyama, kakale tjinozwagwa neMeya imeya. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Usitjename kuti ndati kukuli, ‘Wakafanila kuti uzwagwe butshwa.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mhepo inohhuhhudza iyenda kwayinoda, kakale unowha hhoba yayo, koga usingazibe kuti inobvayi kene kuti inoyenda poni, kwakajalo bo nemubanhu bose banozwagwa neMeya.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodimasi wakati kuwunli, “Kungayetika tjini ikoku?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Undhiyi webaIsirayeli, ngono awutokuwhisisa ikoku? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kukuli, toleba tjatinoziba, kakale topa busupi gwezwinhu zwatabona; koga imwi amutowamutjila busupi gwedu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Hapa ndamubudza zwinhu zwehango koga mukasagalamoyo, mowhogalamoyo tjini hapa ndingamubudza zwinhu zwekudzimu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Akuna nhu wakatongoyenda kudzimu kuhhe kweNkololo wenhu yega, iye wakadeluka ebva kudzimu. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Saku Mozisi akamilidza nyoka mutjilambanyika, ndizo Nkololo weNhu unowhomilidzigwa pehhugwi, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kuti nhu wose unogalamoyo muwunli abe nebutjilo gusingapele.”<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ngobe Ndzimu wakada hango zwingapa, kwekuti wakapila Nkololo uwe uyega, kuti nhu wose unogalamoyo muwunli asife koga abe nebutjilo gusingapele. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ngobe Ndzimu wakatuma Nkololo muhango, esingahhile tonga hango, koga kuti hango itjidziwe muzina lile.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Iye unogalamoyo muwunli haatopiwa nlandu; koga iye usingagalemoyo watjiwanikwa nlandu kale, ngobe haazogalamoyo muzina leNkololo iye yega weNdzimu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Iwhoyu ndiwo ntongo, kuti tjedza tjahha muhango, koga banhu bakada hhalima kupinda tjedza, ngobe zwiyeto zwabo zwakazwilizwibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Ngobe umwe newumwe unoyeta zwibi unohema tjedza, kakale haatohha kutjedza, ngobe eti swiyo zwiyeto zwizwe zwingafumugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Koga iye unoyeta zwinhu zwelebeswa unohha kutjedza, kuti kubon'we patjena kuti zwiyeto zwizwe zwayetiwa ngekugalamoyo muNdzimu.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu naJohane Mbvubiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Hule kwayikoku Yesu wakayenda nebadiyiwa babe kuntunhu weJudiya; akagala nabo ikweno ebvubika banhu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Johane waka ebvubika kuAyenoni pedlo neSalimu, ngobe kwakakuna vula njinji ipapo, banhu bakabehha bebvubikiwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Johane waka asanhu akasiwa mujele.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kwakaba nekukakabadzana pakati kwebadiyiwa baJohane newumwe Njhuta nekwetjenesewa. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bakahha kuna Johane, bakati kuwunli, “Rabhi, iye wamaka munaye seli yaJorodani, iye wamakapa busupi nekukwe, whoyoke, weebvubika, kakale banhu bose beyenda kuwunli.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Johane wakahandula eti, “Akuna ungawamutjila kene ini kuhhe kwekuti atjipiwa tjibva kudzimu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Namwi bo muna busupi, kuti ndakati, ‘Andita iye Khirisitu, koga ndakatumwa mbeli kukwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Iye una nlongo ndiye nkwaha; nkwinya wenkwaha, unoma ntome kukwe ewhilila, unohanhila whi lenkwaha; ndizo ke hanha kwangu ikoku kwapelela. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Wakafanila kuti akudziwe imi nditelele.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iye Unobva kuDzimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Iye unobva pehhugwi upehhugwi kwabo bose; iye unobva muhango ndewehango, kakale unoleba kwehango; iye unobva kudzimu upehhugwi kwabo bose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Unopa busupi gwezwinhu zwaabona nezwaawha, koga akuna unowamutjila busupi gugwe, <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Iye unowamutjila busupi gugwe unobvuma kuti Ndzimu ulebeswa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Nekuti iye wakatumwa neNdzimu unoleba matama eNdzimu, ngobe Ndzimu haatopa Meya ngetjiyelo, <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tate banoda Nkololo, ndizo bakasa zwinhu zose mumaboko awe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Iwhoyo unogalamoyo muNkololo unabutjilo gusingapele, usingawhilile Nkololo haatowhogubona butjilo, koga buhongola gweNdzimu gugele pehhugwi kukwe.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu neNkadzimayi weku Nsamariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Sangwenu Yesu wakati aziba kuti baFarisi bawha kuti Yesu waka eyeta kakale ebvubika badiyiwa banji kupinda Johane, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />(nekutobe Yesu tjekukwe waka asingabvubike, koga kubvubika badiyiwa babe), <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />wakati atjiwha ikoku akabva muJudiya akayenda kakale kuGalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Kwakakwakafanila kuti apinde nemuSamariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ndizo wakaswika kunzi-nkulu weSamariya, unoyi Sayikha, pedlo neminda yaJakobe yaakapa nkololo uwe Josefa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Kwaka kuna tshime laJakobe ipapo, ndizo Yesu, anyala nentha yegwendo, wakagala ntome kwetshime. Kwaka kuli masikati, kungaba lubaka gwe awa yebutanhatu kubvisila hhuba libhuda.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Kwakaswika nkadzimayi wekuSamariya ewhotjela vula. Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Undin'wise.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ngobe badiyiwa babe bakabayenda kunzi-nkulu benotenga zodliwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nkadzimayi weNsamariya wakati kuwunli, “Ngentha yeni mukumbila kuti ndimun'wise, imwi muliNjhuta, imi ndiliNsamariya?” Ngobe maJuta haatodlidzana nemaSamariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu waka wun'handula eti, “Katshene wawuziba tjipo tjeNdzimu, nekuti ndiyani unoti kukuli, ‘Undin'wise,’ wawhowunkumbila, wabe ewhokupa vula inopa butjilo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Nkadzimayi wakati kuwunli, “Tate, amuna tjinhu tjamungatjela natjo, kakale tshime lakajitila, ngono vula inopa butjilo mowhoyiwana poni? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Munkulu pana tate bedu Jakobe, ibo bakatipa tshime ileli, bakan'wa mulili ibo tjekwabo, nebakololo babo, nezwipfuwo zwabo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Umwe newumwe unon'wa vula iyeyi unowhobe nenyota kakale, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />koga unowhon'wa vula yandinowumpa haatjowhobe nenyota kakale, vula yandinowumpa inowhoba nsenya muwunli unobvilila unoswikisa kubutjilo gusingapele.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Nkadzimayi wakati kuwunli, “Tate, mundipe vula iyeyo, kuti ndisitjabe nenyota kakale, nekuti ndisitjabuye ngeno ndowhotjela vula.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Yenda, unodana nlume uwo, ukobuya ngeno.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Nkadzimayi wakawun'handula eti, “Andina nlume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Unolebesa hapa uti, ‘Andina nlume,’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />ngobe wakabe nebalume bahanu, newawunaye sangwenu haate nlume uwo, ipapo walebesa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Nkadzimayi wakati kuwunli, “Tate, ndobona kuti munlebesambeli. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bobatategulu bedu baka benamata Ndzimu padombo ileli, koga imwi maJuta moti muJerusalema ndipo panabugalo gwakafanila kuti gube ipo panonamatigwa Ndzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Nkadzimayi, undigalemoyo, lubaka gowhohha banhu pabasingowhonamatila Tate mudombo ileli kene iko muJerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Imwi maSamariya monamata tjamusingazibe, koga iswi maJuta tonamata tjatinoziba, ngobe tjidziwa kobva kumaJuta. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Koga lubaka gohha, nayiko gwatjiswika, ipapo banhu pabanowhonamata Ndzimu mumeya nemulebeswa, ngobe beli igo ludzi gwebanamati Tate babanohaka. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ndzimu meya, kakale banowhunamata bakafanila wunamata mumeya nemumalebeswa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Nkadzimayi wakati kuwunli, “Ndoziba kuti Mesiya unohha, iye unodan'wa Khirisitu. Hapa ehha, unowhotitjenesela zwinhu zose.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Imi ndinolebeleka nawe ndi iye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Nayigogo lubaka badiyiwa baYesu bakaswika. Bakatjenama bewuwana elebeleka nenkadzimayi iwhoyo, koga akuna wakawumbhuzwa kuti, “Mohakani?” kene iye wakawumbhuzwa kuti, “Molebelekelani naye?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Nkadzimayi eba esiya hali yevula, ebgwilila kunzi-nkulu, akati kubanhu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Ihhani, mubone nlume wandibudza kose kwetjinga kwandakathama. Angabe ali iye Khirisitu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bakabhuda kuhhe kwenzi-nkulu bakayenda kuna Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kutjakajalo badiyiwa bakabekumbilisisa Yesu beti, “Rabhi, idlani zodliwa!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Koga iye wakabahandula eti, “Ndinazo zodliwa zwandinodla imwi zwamusingazibe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ndizo badiyiwa bakatangisa bhuzwana beti, “Kungabe kuna umwe wawumbhatila zodliwa kani?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Zodliwa zwangu whuwhilila iye wakandituma nekuti ndipedze n'hingo waakandipa kuti ndiwunthame. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Amutoti, ‘Kutjina mimwedzi mina, kukoti kohha vuna’? Ndomubudza, musani meho enyu, mulinge minda, zwidlo zwatjiyibva kuti zwivun'we. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Unovuna unowana mibhayilo, kakale unokubunganya mitjelo yebutjilo gusingapele, kuyetila kuti ndzwali nemvuni bahanhe panhu pan'ompela. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Matama iyawa alebeswa anoti, ‘Umwe unodzwala kakale umwe unovuna.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Ndakamutuma kuti munovuna zwamusakahinga, bamwe bakahinga, koga imwi mevuna zwabakatukutilila.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />MaSamariya manjinji anobva kunzi-nkulu iwhoyo akagalamoyo muwunli nentha yebusupi gwenkadzimayi gunoti, “Wandibudza kose kwetjinga kwandakathama.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ndizo maSamariya akati ehha kuwunli, bakawunkumbila kuti agale nabo, akagala po mahhuba mabili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Banjinji kwazo bakagalamoyo ngentha yedama lile. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Bakati kunkadzimayi, “Atitjagalamoyo ngentha yematama awaleba, ngobe tazwiwhila iswi tjekwedu, kakale toziba kuti iwhoyu kwelebeswa ndiye Ntjidzi wehango.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unotjidza Nkololo weGombgwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Hule kwemahhuba mabili wakamilika akayenda kuGalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Ngobe Yesu iye tjekukwe waka apa busupi gwekuti nlebesambeli haana lukudzo muhango yakanyi kukwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ndizo wakati aswika kuGalile, banhu bekuGalile bakawuwamutjila, kuli kuti babona kose kwaakathama kuJerusalema kunzano wePhasika, ngobe nayibo bakabayenda kunzano.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Ndizo wakaswika kakale kuKana muGalile, kwaaka athama vula ikabe wayini. MuKhaphenawume kwakakuna nlume ugombgwa waka egwaligwa nenkololo. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Wakati ewha kuti Yesu wahha kuGalile ebva kuJudiya, wakayenda akanowunkumbila kuti ahhe ewhotjidza nkololo uwe, ngobe waka egwalilafa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Ndizo ke Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Kuhhe kwekuti mubone zwilakidzilo nemakaabadzo amungagalemoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Gombgwa lakati kuwunli, “Tate, ihhani mwana wangu asanhu afa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Yenda, nkololo uwo unowhotjila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Nlumetate iwhoyo wakagalamoyo dama lakalebgwa kuwunli naYesu akayenda zwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Wakati atjimuzila, balanda babe bakawun'hanganidza bakawumbudza kuti nkololo uwe wanaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ndizo wakababhuzwa kuti lubaka ni gwaatangisa ba hine, bakati kuwunli, “Luhhahhamo gwakapela hhulo masikati, mu awa yekutondeka kubvisila hhuba libhuda.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tatayi bakaziba kuti ndigo lubaka Yesu paakati kubali, “Nkololo uwo unowhotjila.” Ibo tjekwabo bakagalamoyo, kose nen'ha wabo bose.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Yetji nditjo tjilakidzilo tjebubili tjakayetiwa naYesu paakahha kuGalile ebva kuJudiya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Polesewa paGan'wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Hule kwayikoku kwakabe nenzano wemaJuta, naYesu bo wakayenda kuJerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Sangwenu muJerusalema paNkoba weMhwizi kwaka kuna gan'wa, linodan'wa netjiHhebheru kuyiBhethesida, lina makutukutu mahanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ipapo kwakakuna bagwele banjinji balele po, mapofu, zwilema, nebakalobgwa negulukadzi. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dzimwe whalo whulukugwi adzina vesi yebuna.</char></note>[Mugumwe lubaka ntumwa waHe waka edelukila mugan'wa ebva kudzimu, ehha edzonga vula. Waka etangila bamwe ngina mugan'wa hule kwedzongewa kwevula waka epola bugwele gwaanago nekutobe guli gupi.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ipapo kwaka kuna umwe nlume, waka egwala kwemakole alimakumi matatu anahhanakadzi. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu wakawumbona alilele ipapo, akaziba kuti waka egwala kwelubaka gulefulefu, ndizo wakawumbhuzwa eti, “Unohaka naya kene?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Nlume unogwala wakati, “He, akuna nhu ipapa ungandisa mugan'wa vula payinodzongeka, ndoti nditjahaka ngina, umwe ebe engina enditangila.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Milika, tola nhobo iyo, uyende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Tjinyolotjo nlume iwhoyo wakabva anaya, wakamilika akatola nhobo iye akayenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Nsi wakayetika kose ikoku waka uli nsi wesabatha. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Ndizo bakulu bemaJuta bakabudza nlume waka apodzewa beti, “Nasi ihhuba lesabatha, kakale akuta munlayo kuti usenge nhobo iyo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Wakahandula eti, “Wandipodza wandibudza eti nditole nhobo yangu ndiyende.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bakawumbhuzwa beti, “Ndiyani iwhoyo nlume wati kukuli utole nhobo iyo uyende?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Koga nlume waka apolesewa waka asingazibe kuti kwakabe kuliyani, ngobe Yesu waka atjingina mubanhu akamila, ngobe kwakakuna mbunga webanhu mubugalo igogo.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Hule kwayikoku, Yesu wakawuwana muthempeli akati kuwunli, “Bona, watjinaya! Usitjatjinye kakale, kuyetila kuti usitjawigwe nekwakayipa kunopinda ikoku.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Nlume iwhoyu wakayenda akanobudza bakulu bemaJuta kuti wapodzewa ndiYesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ndizo bakulu bemaJuta bakatangisa dziyidza Yesu, ngobe ikoku waka ekuthama muhhuba leSabatha. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Tate bangu banogala behinga, nami bo ndakafanila hinga.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ndebo iyeyi yakathama kuti bakulu bemaJuta bazwipile kwazo wumbulaya, ngobe wakabe asavuna nlayo wesabatha koga, koga wakabe eti Ndzimu ndiTate babe, nayiyeyo zila wake azwilizanyisa neNdzimu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masimba eNkololo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, akuna Nkololo tjaangathama ali yega, koga unothama tjaanobona Tate babe bethama, ngobe kene ini tjinothamiwa naTate, neNkololo bo unotjithama. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ngobe Tate banoda Nkololo, kakale banowunlakidza kose kwabanothama ibo tjekwabo, kakale banowhowunlakidza mihingo mikulukulu kupinda iyeyi, kuti imwi mutjename. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ngobe saTate bemusa bafi bebapa butjilo, Nkololo bo unopa butjilo kuna waanoda pa. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Kakale, Tate abatotonga nhu, koga bakapa masimba ose etonga kuNkololo, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />kuyetila kuti bose balemekedze Nkololo, sekwabanolemekedza Tate. Iye usingalemekedze Nkololo haatolemekedza Tate bakawuntuma.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, iye unowha dama langu akagalamoyo muna wakandituma, unabutjilo gusingapele, haatowhoswika pakutongwa, koga watjipinda mulufu wabe kubutjilo. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, lubaka gohha, nangwenu gwaswika, ipapo bakafa pabanowhowha whi leNkololo weNdzimu, kakale ibabo banoliwha banowhotjila. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ngobe saTate banabutjilo mubali tjekwabo, bakapa Nkololo kuti abe nebutjilo muwunli, <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />kakale bakawumpa masimba ekuti atonge, ngentha yekuti uNkololo weNhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Musitjenamisiwe nayikoku, ngobe lubaka gowhohha ipapo bose bamuzwikumbu pabanowhowha whi lile <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />banowhobhuda muzwikumbu, bakabeyeta zwibuya banowhomuka bakatjila, na ibabo bakayeta zwibi banowhomusiwa beyenda kunotongewa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basupi nekwaYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Akuna tjandingathama ngemasimba angu, ndotonga sewha kwangu, netonga kwangu kwakalulama, ngobe anditohaka kunobe kulikuda kwangu koga tjinodiwa nayiwhoyo wakandituma.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Hapa ndizwilebela busupi, busupi gwangu aguta gwelebeswa, <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />kuna umwe nhu unopa busupi nekwangu, kakale ndoziba kuti busupi gwaanopa nekwangu ndegwelebeswa. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Makatuma banhu kunaJohane, akapa busupi nekwelebeswa. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Akuta kuti ndohaka busupi gunobva kubanhu; koga ndoleba ikoku kuyetila kuti imwi mutjidziwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Johane waka elitjivoneko tjinopfuta kakale tjingayima, namwi bo makahala hanha mutjedza tjitje kwelubakanyana. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Koga busupi gwandinago gopinda gwaJohane; ngobe mihingo yandakapiwa naTate kuti ndiyipedze, iyo iyeyi mihingo yandinoyeta, inopa busupi nekwangu kuti Tate bakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Nayibo Tate bakandituma banopa busupi nekwangu. Imwi amanhu mukatongowha whi labo, netjimo tjabo amanhu mukatjibona, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />nedama labo alitogala mumuli, ngobe amutogalamoyo muna iye wabakatuma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mohakisisa mudziwhalo, ngobe mokumbula kuti mudzili munabutjilo gusingapele, koga ndidzo ke dzinopa busupi nekwangu, <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />koga molamba hha kundili kuti mube nebutjilo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Anditowamutjila gudzo linobva kubanhu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Koga ndomuziba imwi, ndoziba kuti amuna ludo gweNdzimu mumuli. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Ndahha muzina laTate, amutondiwamutjila, koga kukahha umwe ehha muzina lile, ndiye wamunowhowamutjila. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mungagalamoyo tjini, imwi muwamutjila gudzo linobva kuwumwe newumwe koga musingahake gudzo linobva kuNdzimu iye yega? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Musikumbule kuti ndowhomulonga nlandu mbeli kwaTate, ndiMozisi unomulonga nlandu, iye wamunogalabgwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Hapa mamugalamoyo munaMozisi, mamowhogalamoyo mundili, ngobe wakakwala nekwangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Koga hapa musingagalemoyo muna zwaakakwala, mowhogalamoyo matama angu tjini?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unopa Zodliwa Banhu Bali Zwiwulu Zwihanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matewu 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Hule kwayikoku Yesu wakayenda seli yegungwa lekuGalile, ilo linoyi gungwa leThibheriyasi. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Akatobegwa nebunga lebanhu, ngobe bakabebona zwilakidzilo zwaaka ethama kubanhu banogwala. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu wakatanha pehhugwi kwedombo, akaswika egala pasi nebadiyiwa babe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Sangwenu Phasika, nzano wemaJuta waka wabe pedlo. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Emilidza meho awe, ebona kuti bunga lebanhu gulu lohha kuwunli, Yesu wakati kunaFiliphi, “Tingatenga poni tjinkwa, kuti banhu ibaba badle?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Wakangoleba ikoku kuti alike Filiphi, kanha wake eziba zwe kuti unowhothamani.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filiphi wakawun'handula eti, “Makulu mabili emadinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nlipo wemimwedzi ili kutanhatu</char></note> haangatenge zwinkwa zwekuti umwe newumwe angowana kuhomanana kwebhata bula.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Umwe webadiyiwa babe, unoyi Andhireya, nun'una waSimoni Phethiro, wakati kuwunli, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Kuna mbisana ipapa una zwinkwa zwihanu zwebhali newhobe mbili, koga kungalizana banhu bose ibaba?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Thamani kuti banhu bagale pasi.” Kwaka kulihhele buhwa ipapo; ndizo banhu bakagala pasi; kwaka kuna balume bangaswika zwiwulu zwihanu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu wakakotola zwinkwa, akaboka Ndzimu, wakati apedza boka, akakobela ibabo bakabaligele pasi; akathama ejalo bo newhobe, bose bakadla sekwabaka betubula. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bakati badla baguta, akati kubadiyiwa babe, “Wolelani zwipemu zwasala, kusibe netjinozanisika.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Ndizo bakawolela zwipemu zwezwinkwa zwebhali zwihanu zwakazwasiyiwa nebakabedla, bakahhadza zwitundu zwiligumi nezwibili.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:11">Mat 21.11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Banhu bakati bebona tjilakidzilo tjaayeta, bakati, “Iwhoyu ndiye nlebesambeli dumbu wakafanila kuti ahhe muhango!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:3">Joh 6.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:36">18.36</ref>.</char></note>Yesu wakati ebona kuti banobva bebuya bewhowuntola nemasimba kuti bawunthame mambo, akabe enyeluka enobgwata mudombo ali yega.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unoyenda Pehhugwi kwevula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matewu 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Kwakati kwatjiba madekwana badiyiwa babe bakajitila kugungwa, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />bakangina mukepe, bakamilika bepalama gungwa beyenda kuKhaphenawume. Kwaka kwatjibe hhalima, koga Yesu asanhu akahha kubali. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Vula yegungwa yakakabhukana ngobe kwakakuhhuhhudza mhepo inamasimba. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Kwakati kepe tjatjiyenda kwemakhilomitha angaba mahanu kene matanhatu, bakabona Yesu eyenda pehhugwi kwegungwa esedzela pedlo nekepe. Bakahla, <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />koga iye wakati kubali, “Ndimi, musihle.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Bakahanha kuti bawunginise mukepe, tjinyolotjo kepe tjakabva tjaswika pahango kwabaka beyenda.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banhu Banohaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Muhhuba linotobela banhu bakabaliseli yegungwa bakabona kuti kwakuna kepe tjin'ompela koga ipapo, nekuti Yesu haazongina mukepe nebadiyiwa babe, koga badiyiwa babe bakabamilika baliboga. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Koga ke, kwakaswika zwikepe zwinobva kuThibheriyasi pedlo nebugalo gwabakadlila tjinkwa hule kwekusinobe He aboka. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ndizo banhu bakati bebona kuti Yesu aatapo, kene ibo badiyiwa babe, bakangina muzwikepe bakayenda kuKhaphenawume, behaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Utjinkwa Tjebutjilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bakati bewuwana seli yegungwa, bakati kuwunli, “Rabhi, makahha lini ngeno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, mondihaka, kusi nentha yekuti makabona zwilakidzilo, koga nentha yekuti makadla mukaguta zwinkwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Musihingile zodliwa zwinowhopalala, koga hingilani zodliwa zwinogala kudzina kunobe kubutjilo gusingapele, gwamunowhopiwa neNkololo weNhu, ngobe pawunli Ndzimu Tate bakasa lutjayo gwabo gwebvuma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bakakotjiti kuwunli, “Titeni, kuti tithame mihingo yeNdzimu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Iwhoyu ndiwo n'hingo weNdzimu, kuti mugalemoyo muna iye waakatuma.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ndizo bakati kuwunli, “Ngono nowhothama tjilakidzilo ludzini, kuti tibone, tikugalemoyo? Unowhotiyetila n'hingo ludzini? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bobatategulu bedu bakadla mana mutjilambanyika, sekwakakwagwa, ‘Wakabapa tjinkwa tjinobva kudzimu kuti badle.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu wakakoti kubali, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, kwaka kusiMozisi wakamupa tjinkwa tjinobva kudzimu, Tate bangu ndibo banomupa tjinkwa tjakwako tjinobva kudzimu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ngobe tjinkwa tjeNdzimu ndi iwhoyo unojita ebva kudzimu, unopa butjilo muhango.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bakati kuwunli, “He, mugale mutipa tjinkwa itjetji.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Imi ndimi tjinkwa tjebutjilo, iye unohha kundili haatowhobe nehhala, kakale unogalamoyo mundili haatowhobe nenyota. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Koga ndati kumuli, mandibona koga amutondigalamoyo. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Bose bandinopiwa naTate banowhohha kundili, kakale bose banowhohha kundili anditowhobatata. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Nekuti ndakajetuka ndibva kudzimu, kusi kuti ndiwhothama kuda kwangu koga kuti ndiyete kuda kwewakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Whoku ndiko kuda kwewakandituma, kuti ndisitongolahikigwa newumwe wa ibabo bose baakandipa, koga kuti ndibamuse bose muhhuba lebupelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ngobe whoku ndiko kuda kwaTate bangu, kuti umwe newumwe unobona Nkololo akagalamoyo muwunli abe nebutjilo gusingapele, kakale ndowhowumusa pahhuba lebupelo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />MaJuta akatangisa n'un'una nekukwe, ngobe wakati, “Nditjinkwa tjakajita tjibva kudzimu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bakati, “Haate iye Yesu iwhoyu, nkololo waJosefa, unatatayi namayi batinoziba? Ngono unoti, ‘Ndakajita ndibva kudzimu tjini?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Musin'un'une pakati kwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Akuna nhu ungahha kundili kuhhe kwekuti Tate bakandituma bawuhhisa, kakale ndowhowumusa muhhuba lebupelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Kwakakwagwa nebalebesambeli kuti, ‘Bose banowhodiyiwa neNdzimu.’ Umwe newumwe wakawha akadiyika kubva kuna Tate unohha kundili. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Akuna wakatongobona Tate kuhhe kwayiye unobva kuNdzimu, ndiye wakabona Tate. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, iye unogalamoyo unabutjilo gusingapele. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Imi ndimi tjinkwa tjebutjilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bobatategulu benyu bakadla mana mutjilambanyika, bakafa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Yetji nditjo tjinkwa tjakajita tjibva kudzimu, kuti nhu unotjidla asife. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Imi nditjinkwa tjipenyu tjakabva kudzimu, unowhotjidla itjetji tjinkwa, unowhotjila nekusingapele, tjinkwa tjandinowhopa kuti hango yose ibe nebutjilo umbili wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />MaJuta akakakabadzana eti, “Nlume iwhoyu ungatipa mbili uwe kuti tidle tjini?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Ndizo Yesu wakati kubali, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, kuhhe kwekuti mudle mbili weNkololo weNhu kakale mun'we malopa awe, amuna butjilo mumuli, <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />iye unodla mbili wangu en'wa malopa angu unabutjilo gusingapele, kakale ndowhowumusa muhhuba lebupelo, <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />ngobe mbili wangu izodliwa zwakwako, kakale malopa angu ndetjinon'wiwa tjakwako. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Iye unodla mbili wangu kakale en'wa malopa angu unogala mundili, nami ndogala muwunli. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Sekwandakatumwa naTate bapenyu, ndotjila nentha yaTate, ndizo unondidla unowhotjila nentha yangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Nditjo itjetji tjinkwa tjakajita tjibva kudzimu, atjitonga tjinkwa tjakadliwa nabobatategulu benyu bakakofa, iye unodla tjinkwa itjetji unowhotjila nekusingapele.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Wakakuleba kose ikoku musinagogu, ediya muKhaphenawume.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matama Ebutjilo Gusingapele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Bunji gwebadiyiwa babe, bakati bekuwha ikoku, bakati, “Indebo inolema iyeyi, ndiyani ungayiwhilila?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Koga Yesu, eziba mukati kukwe kuti badiyiwa banon'un'urika nekwako, wakati kubali, “Magwadziwa nayikoku? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ngono mukabona Nkololo weNhu ewulukila pehhugwi eyenda kwaaka aliko kutanga ke? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Meya ndiyo inopa butjilo, nyama ayina bhatsho, matama andaleba kumuli ameya nebutjilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Koga kuna bamwe benyu basingagalemoyo.” Ngobe Yesu waka eziba kubvisila kutanga kuti ndiboyani basingagalemoyo, nekuti ndiyani unowhowuntengesa. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Wakati, “Ndizo ndakamubudza kuti akuna nhu unowhohha kundili kuhhe kwekuti abvumigwa naTate.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Hule kwayikoku bunji gwebadiyiwa babe bakabgwilila hule bakaletja yenda naye. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu wakati kuna baligumi nebabili, “Namwi bo moyemula yenda bo?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Phethiro wakawuhandula eti, “He, tokoyenda kuna yani? Imwi muna matama ebutjilo gusingapele; <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />kakale tegalamoyo, kakale teeziba kuti imwi ndimwi wakaYengemala weNdzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Andizomuhala, imwi muligumi nebabili? Koga umwe wenyu ndiSatane.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Waka eleba nekwaJudasi nkololo waSimoni Isikariyoti, ngobe nekene waka ali umwe webaligumi nebabili, waka ewhowuntengesa.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Nebanun'una Babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Hule kwayikoku Yesu wakapoteleka muGalile, waka asingatubule poteleka muJudiya, ngobe batungamili bemaJuta baka behaka wumbulaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Sangwenu nzano wemaJuta weMajatja waka wabe pedlo, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />ndizo banun'una babe bakati kuwunli, “Ibva pano uyende kuJudiya, kuti badiyiwa babo babone mihingo yawunoyeta. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ngobe akuna nhu unohinga akabgwata iye ehaka zibgwa patjena. Hapa uthama izwezwi zwinhu, thama kuti hango izibe nekuko.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />(Ngobe nayibo banun'una babe bakabasingagalemoyo muwunli.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Lubaka gwangu agwanhu gwaswika, koga gwenyu lubaka gogala gulipo. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Hango ayingamuheme, koga imi inondihema ngobe ndopa busupi nekwemihingo yayo kuti yakayipa. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Yendani kunzano imwi tjekwenyu, imi anditoyenda kunzano iwhoyu, ngobe lubaka gwangu agwanhu gwaswika.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ejalo, wakabva asala muGalile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alikunzano weMajatja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Koga hule kwekusinobe banun'una babe bayenda kunzano, nayiye wakasala etobela kunzano, asipatjena koga akabgwata. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Batungamili bemaJuta baka bewumvima kunzano, beti, “Uponi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kukabe nekun'un'urika kunji nekukwe pakati kwebanhu. Bamwe beti, “Unlume wakalulama,” bamwe beti, “Aa, unotungamilila banhu ntome.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Koga nentha yehla batungamili bemaJuta akuna nhu waka elebeleka nekukwe patjena.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Kwakati pakati napakati kwelubaka gwenzano Yesu eba eyenda kuthempeli akatangisa diya. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Batungamili bemaJuta bakatjenamisiwa nayikoku, bakati, “Koyetiwa neni kuti nlume iwhoyu abeneluzibo, iye esakadiyika.”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Ndizo Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Tjidiyo tjangu atjite tjangu, koga ndetje wakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Hapa kuda kwenhu kuli kuti ayete kuda kweNdzimu, unowhoziba kuti tjidiyo tjangu tjobva kuNdzimu kene kuti ndolebeleka ngesimba langu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Unolebeleka nesimba lile unozwihakila gudzo, koga iye unohaka gudzo lewakawuntuma unamalebeswa, kakale muwunli akuna manyepwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mozisi haazomupa nlayo? Koga akuna umwe wenyu unotjengeta nlayo. Mohaka ndibulayilani?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Banhu bakahandula beti, “Una meyambi! Ndiyani unohaka kubulaya?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Ndayeta tjiyeto tjin'ompela, mose tjamutjenamisa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Mozisi wakamupa thumbigwa (kusi kuti kwakabva kuna Mozisi, koga kwakabva kuna bobatategulu), mothumbila mwana wetjilume muhhuba lesabatha. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Hapa kuli kuti muhhuba lesabatha mwana wetjilume unowamutjila thumbigwa, kuyetila kuti nlayo waMozisi usitjulukiwe, mandigwadziligwa ngobe ndayeta kuti mbili wose wenlume iwhoyu upole nehhuba lesabatha? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Musitonge nekuti nhu unolingika tjini, koga tongani ngetonga kwakalulama.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiye Mesiya?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bamwe bebanhu bemuJerusalema bakakoti, “Haate iye iwhoyu nlume wabanohaka bulaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Ngono whoyu upano, elebeleka patjena, koga akuna tjabanoleba kuwunli! Kungabe iko kene kuti batungamili banoziba kwelebeswa kuti iwhoyu ndiye Khirisitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Koga iswi toziba kuti nlume iwhoyu unobva poni; hapa Khirisitu ehha, akuna unowhoziba kuti unobva poni.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ndizo Yesu wakaleba newhi lipehhugwi, paaka ediya muthempeli eti, “Mondiziba, kakale moziba kwandinobva. Koga andizozwihhila, iye wakandituma ulebeswa, amutowhunziba. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Imi ndowunziba, ngobe ndobva kuwunli, kakale wakandituma.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ndizo bakahaka kuti bawunsunge, koga akuna nhu wakawumbhata, ngobe lubaka gugwe gwakagusanhu gwaswika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Koga banhu banjinji bakabegalamoyo muwunli, bakati, “Hapa Khirisitu ehha, unowhoyeta zwilakidzilo zwinopinda zwayetiwa nenlume iwhoyu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balindi Banotumwa Kuti Banosunga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />BaFarisi bakawha banhu ben'un'urika nekukwe, baphirisiti bakulu nebaFarisi bakatuma balindi kuti banowunsunga. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu wakakoti, “Ndowhobe namwi kwelubaka gufupifupi, ndikobgwilila kuna wakandituma, <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />mowhondihaka mukandihaya, kwandinowhoba ndiliko amungahhe ko.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />MaJuta akati umwe kuwumwe, “Nlume iwhoyu unowhondayi kwatisingowhowuwana? Angabe ehaka yenda kuna bakapalalila kumaGiriki enodiya maGiriki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Unobvani hapa eti, ‘Mowhondihaka mukandihaya,’ kakale eti, ‘Kwandinowhoba ndiliko amungahhe ko’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njizi Dzevula Inopa Butjilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Muhhuba lebupelo lenzano, linoba lilihhuba gulu, Yesu wakamilika akadanilila eti, “Hapa kuna unanyota ngaahhe kundili an'we. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Iwhoyo unogalamoyo mundili sekwakwakakwagwa mulukwalo kuti, ‘Kubva mukati kukwe kowhowunga njizi dzevula inopa butjilo.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Sangwenu whoku waka ekuleba eleba nekweMeya, yakayowhowamutjigwa nebanogalamoyo muwunli, ngobe Meya yaka isanhu ikapiwa banhu, ngobe Yesu waka asanhu akakudziwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Palalana Pakati kweBanhu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bakati bewha matama ihawa, bamwe banhu bakati, “Iwhoyu ndiye Nlebesambeli ntja.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bamwe bakati, “Iwhoyu ndiye Khirisitu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Koga bamwe bakati, “Kuti Khirisitu unowhohha ebva kuGalile? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Whalo adzizoleba kuti Khirisitu unowhobhuda muludzi gwaDavida, ebva kuBhethelehhema, kunzi waka ugala Davida?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Ndizo kwakabe nemhalalano pakati kwebanhu nentha yaYesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bamwe babo baka behaka wunsunga, koga akuna nhu wakawumbhata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sagalamoyo kweBatungamili bemaJuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Balindi bakabgwilila kubaphirisiti bakulu nebaFarisi, bakabe beti kubalindi, “Maletjelani hha naye?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Balindi bakahandula beti, “Akuna nhu wakatongolebeleka senlume iwhoyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />BaFarisi bakabahandula beti, “Matjitungamiligwa ntome, namwi bo? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Kuna bamwe bebatungamili kene baFarisi bagalamoyo muwunli? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Imwi banhu basingazibe nlayo, makalongwa bhiso.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodimasi, wakatongoba ayenda kuwunli, ali umwe wabo, wakati kubali, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Nlayo wedu unowana nhu nlandu, nhu asanhu akatongobhuzwiwa kukazibgwa tjaayeta?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bakahandula beti, “Nawe unobva kuGalile bo? Hakisisa unowhobona kuti akuna nlebesambeli ungabva kuGalile.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Umwe newumwe wakayenda kunzi uwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Nkadzimayi Wakabhakhwa Mubupombgwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Koga Yesu wakayenda kuDombo leMitoba. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Mangwanana ngwanana wakahha kakale kuthempeli, banhu bose bakahha kuwunli, akagala pasi akabadiya. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bakwali nebaFarisi bakangina behhisa nkadzimayi waka abhakhwa ethama bupombgwe, bakawumisa mbeli kwabo bose. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bakati kuwunli, “Ndhiyi, nkadzimayi iwhoyu wabhakhwa elipakati kwethama bupombgwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Sangwenu munlayo Mozisi wakatilaya kuti tikhikitidze banhu bakajali ngemabgwe. Motini nekukwe?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bakaleba bejalo kuti bawunlike, kuti bawane nlandu wabangawuntilika. Koga Yesu wakahunama akakwala mumavu nelunyala gugwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pabakayendilambeli bewumbhuzwa, wakahunamuka akati kubali, “Usina jinyo pakati kwenyu ngaabe iye unotanga unowumposa nebgwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Akapamha akahunama ekwala mumavu ngelunyala. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Koga bakati bekuwha ikoku, umwe newumwe akabva ipapo akayenda, kutanga newhola pabamwe, Yesu akasala aliyega nenkadzimayi ali mbeli kukwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu wakamilidza meho akati kuwunli, “Nkadzimayi, baponi? Utjiyapo wakuwana nlandu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Wakati, “Akuna He.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu wakati, “Nami bo anditokuwana nlandu, yenda, usitjapamhe ukatjinya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndiye Tjedza tjeHango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu wakalebeleka nabo kakale eti, “Imi nditjedza tjehango, unonditobela haatowhoyenda muhhalima, koga unowhobe netjedza tjebutjilo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />BaFarisi bakakotjiti kuwunli, “Unozwiyetila busupi, busupi gugo aguta gwelebeswa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Nekutobe ndizwiyetila busupi nekwangu, busupi gwangu ndegwelebeswa, ngobe ndoziba kwandakabva nekwandinoyenda, koga imwi amutoziba kwandakabva kene kwandinoyenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Tonga kwenyu ndekwenyama, koga imi anditotonga nhu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ngono nekene nditonga, tonga kwangu ndekwelebeswa, ngobe akuta imi ndoga ndinotonga, koga ndimi naTate bakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Munlayo wenyu kwakakwagwa kuti busupi gwebanhu babili gulebeswa, <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />ndopa busupi nekwangu, naTate bakandituma banopa busupi nekwangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bakakotjiti kuwunli, “Tate babo baponi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu wakahandula eti, “Amutondiziba naTate bangu amutobaziba, hapa mamundiziba, mamowhoziba Tate bangu bo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Matama iyawa wakaaleba ediya muthempeli, alipedlo nepanobigwa zwipo, koga akuna wakawunsunga, ngobe lubaka gugwe gwakagusanhu gwaswika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amungayende Kwandinoyenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Wakapamha akati kubali, “Ndoyenda, mowhondihaka mukafila mujinyo lenyu, kwandinoyenda, amungahhe ko.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Batungamili bemaJuta bakati, “Unowhozwibulaya, saku eti, ‘Kwandinoyenda, amungahhe ko.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Wakati kubali, “Imwi mobva pasi, imi ndobva pehhugwi, imwi mubehango iyeyi, imi andite wehango ino. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ndamubudza kuti mowhofila mumatjinyo enyu, ngobe mowhofila mumatjinyo enyu kuhhe kwekuti mugalemoyo kuti imi ndimi iye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bakati kuwunli, “Ndiwe yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Ikoku kwandakamubudza kubvisila kutanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ndina kunjinji kwandinohaka leba nekwenyu, nekunjinji kwandingatonga nekwenyu, koga iye wakandituma ulebeswa, kakale ndowhobudza hango kwandakawha kubva kuna iye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Abazowhisisa kuti wakabe elebeleka nabo nekwaTate. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ndizo Yesu wakati, “Hapa mamilidzila pehhugwi Nkololo weNhu, ndiko kwamunowhoziba kuti ‘ndi Iye’; kakale akuna tjandinoyeta nemasimba angu koga ndolebeleka sekwandakadiyiwa naTate bangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Newakandituma unami, haazondisiya ndoga, ngobe ndogala ndiyeta tjinowun'hanhisa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Bunji gwebakawuwha elebeleka matama iyawa bakagalamoyo muwunli.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lebeswa Lowhomusunungula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu wakakotjiti kumaJuta akabe agalamoyo muwunli, “Mukayendilambeli mulimudama langu, mubadiyiwa bangu kwemalebeswa, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />kakale mowhoziba lebeswa, kakale lebeswa lowhomuthama kuti mube bakasununguka.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bakawun'handula beti, “Tibana baAbhurahhamu, kakale atanhu tikabebalanda kene bayani zwe. Ngono unoleba tjini uti, ‘Mowhosunungugwa?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, nhu wose unoyeta jinyo unlanda wejinyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Nlanda haana bugalo tjoselele mun'umba tjatjose, koga nkololo unogala tjatjose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ndizo Nkololo akamusunungula, moba masunungugwa dumbu. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndoziba kuti mutjizekugwana tjaAbhurahhamu, koga mohaka ndibulaya, ngobe matama angu ahaya bugalo mumuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Imi ndoleba tjandakabona muna Tate bangu, imwi mothama tjamakawha natate benyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bakawun'handula beti, “Abhurahhamu nditate bedu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu wakati kubali, “Hapa mamuli bana baAbhurahhamu, mamowhothama tjakayetiwa naAbhurahhamu, <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />koga sangwenu mohaka ndibulaya, imi nlume wakamubudza lebeswa landakawha neNdzimu, ikoku ateyiko kwakayetiwa naAbhurahhamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mothama tjakayetiwa natate benyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Bakati kuwunli, “Atizozwagwa ngepinga, tina Tate ban'ompela, iye Ndzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Hapa Ndzimu babeli Tate benyu, mamowhondida, ngobe ndakahha ndibva kuNdzimu, andizozwihhila, koga bakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ngentha yeni musingawhisise tjandinoleba? Kungentha yekuti amutotubula wha dama langu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mubana batate benyu, Satane, kuda kwenyu whuyeta zwinoyemugwa natate benyu. Waka alimbulayi kubvisila kwekutangisa, kakale haana tjimwe nekwelebeswa, ngobe muwunli akuna lebeswa. Hapa enyepa, unoleba kunoyendilana nembumbiko iye, ngobe unyepi kakale nditate bemanyepwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Koga, ngentha yekuti ndoleba lebeswa, amutondigalamoyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ndiyani wenyu unganditi ndina jinyo? Hapa ndileba malebeswa, kungentha yeni musingandigalemoyo? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Iye unobva kuNdzimu, unowha matama eNdzimu, tjinoyeta kuti musi awhe whuti amuta beNdzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu naAbhurahhamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Batungamili bemaJuta bakawun'handula beti, “Atitolebesa hapa titi uNsamariya kakale unameyambi?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Andina meyambi, koga ndolemekedza Tate bangu, imwi amutondilemekedza. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Imi anditozwihakila gudzo, uyapo unolihaka kakale ndiye unowhoba ntongi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa ndoti kumuli, hapa alipo unotjengeta dama langu, haatowhobona lufu kene nalini.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Batungamili bemaJuta bakati kuwunli, “Ngwenu teeziba kuti unameyambi. Abhurahhamu wakafa, nebalebesambeli bo, iwe unoti, ‘Hapa kuna unotjengeta dama langu, haatowhobona lufu kene nalini.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Unkulu pana tate bedu Abhurahhamu, ibo bakafa? Nebalebesambeli bakafa! Iwe unozwithama yani?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Hapa ndizwikudza, gudzo langu alitetjimwe; ndiTate bangu banondikudza, ibo bamunoti ndiNdzimu wenyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Koga amutobaziba, imi ndobaziba. Hapa ndingati, anditobaziba, ndowhoba nyepi samwi, koga ndobaziba kakale ndotjengeta dama labo. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tate benyu Abhurahhamu bakahanha kuti banowhobona hhuba langu; bakalibona bakahanha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Batungamili bemaJuta bakakoti kuwunli, “Awunhu ukaba nemakole makumi mahanu, ngono Abhurahhamu wakawumbona poni?”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, Abhurahhamu asanhu akabepo, ndi Iye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ndizo bakanunga mabgwe kuti bawumphobole nawo, koga Yesu wakabgwata, akabhuda muthempeli.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unotjidza Nlume Wakazwagwa Ali Bhofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu wakati eyenda muzila, akabona nlume waka alibhofu kubvisila pakuzwagwa kukwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Badiyiwa babe bakawumbhuzwa beti, “Rabhi, ndiyani wakatjinya, ndiye nlume iwhoyu kene bazwadzi babe, kuti adze azwagwe ali bhofu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Akuta kuli kuti nlume iwhoyu wakatjinya, kene ibo bazwadzi babe, koga ibhofu kuyetila kuti mihingo yeNdzimu ilakidziwe muwunli. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Takafanila hinga mihingo yewakandituma, kutjimasikati, busiku gowhohha, pasingowhoba nenhu unotubula hinga. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Hapa nditjimuhango, nditjedza tjehango.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Wakati ejalo, akapfila mate pasi akathama dope nemate akahhodza meho enlume iwhoyo nedope, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />eti kuwunli, “Yenda, unongula kugan'wa linoyi Silowamu” (Kuleba kuti Tumwa). Ndizo wakayenda akanongula akahanduka obona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Babakidzani nebamwe bakawumbona kutanga etjayenda ekumbila, bakati, “Akuta iye nlume iwhoya waka etongoba ekumbila?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamwe bakati, “Ndiye,” bamwe bakati, “Aa, koga unofanana naye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Iye wakabahandula eti, “Ndimi nlume iwhoya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bakahwelela bewumbhuzwa beti, “Ngono meho awo ahhulika tjini?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Wakahandula eti, “Nlume unoyi Yesu wathama dope akandihhodza pameho akati kundili, ‘Yenda unongula kuSilowamu,’ ndizo ndayenda ndikanongula ndikabona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bakati kuwunli, “Uponi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Iye wakahandula eti, “Anditoziba.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">BaFarisi Banohakisisa nekwePodzewa kwebhofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Banhu bakahhisa nlume waka atongoba bhofu kubaFarisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Sangwenu laka lili hhuba leSabatha Yesu paaka athama dope akapofunula bhofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />BaFarisi bakapamha bakawumbhuzwa kuti wawamutjila bona tjini. Iye wakati kubali, “Wandibhoma dope pameho angu, ndikangula, ndizo ndeebona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bamwe bebaFarisi bakati, “Nlume iwhoyu haatobva kuNdzimu, Ngobe haatolemekedza Sabatha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Koga bamwe bakati, “Nhu untjinyi angayeta tjini zwilakidzilo zwakajali?” Kwakabe nekupalalana pakati kwabo.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bakapamha kakale beti kunlume wayelibhofu, “Iwe unotini nekukwe, saku ahhula meho awo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Wakati, “Unlebesambeli.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Batungamili bemaJuta baka besingagalemoyo kuti waka ali bhofu wapofunuka, bakadza bakadana bazwadzi benlume waka apofunuka, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />bakababhuzwa beti, “Unkololo wenyu iwhoyu, wamunoti wakazwagwa ali bhofu? Weebona tjini?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Bazwadzi babe bakahandula beti, “Toziba kuti unkololo wedu, kakale kuti wakazwagwa ali bhofu; <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />koga kuti weebona tjini atitoziba, kene iko kuti ndiyani wahhula meho awe. Muwumbhuzwe; watjikula, unowhozwilebelekela.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Bazwadzi babe bakaleba ikoku ngobe bakabehla batungamili bemaJuta, ngobe batungamili bemaJuta baka babvumilana kuti kene yani unowhobvuma kuti Yesu ndiye Khirisitu, unowhotakhwa musinagogu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ndizo bazwadzi babe bakati, “Muwumbhuzwe, watjikula, unowhozwilebelekela.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Gwebubili bakadana nlume wayelibhofu, bakati kuwunli, “Lumbidza Ndzimu, toziba kuti nlume iwhoyu untjinyi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Wakabahandula eti, “Kuti kene untjinyi, anditoziba, tjin'ompela nditjo tjandinoziba, kuti nekutobe ndandili bhofu ngwenu ndeebona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bakati kuwunli, “Wathamani kukuli? Wahhula tjini meho awo?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Wakabahandula eti, “Ndamubudza kale, amuzowhilila. Mohakilani wha kakale? Namwi bo meehaka ba badiyiwa babe kani?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bakawuntuka, beti, “Iwe ndiwe ndhiyiwa uwe, koga iswi tibadiyiwa baMozisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Toziba kuti Ndzimu wakalebeleka naMozisi, koga whoyu nlume, atitoziba kuti unobva poni.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Nlume iwhoyo wakahandula eti, “Nentha yeni, yeli ijenamiso! Amutoziba kwaanobva, koga wahhula meho angu. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Toziba kuti Ndzimu atowhilila batjinyi, koga hapa nhu ali namati weNdzimu kakale eyeta kuda kukwe, Ndzimu unowuwhilila. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kwetjinga hango kwayakabayapo akuna wakatongowha kuyi uyapo wakatongopofula nhu wakazwagwa alibhofu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Hapa nlume iwhoyu wabe asingabve kuNdzimu wabe asingowhothama tjinhu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bakawun'handula beti, “Wakazwaligwa mujinyo, ngono weyedza tidiya?” Bakawuntatila kuhhe.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupofu gweMeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu wakawha kuti bawuntata, wakati awuwana akati kuwunli, “Unogalamoyo muNkololo weNhu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Wakahandula eti, “Ndiye yani iwhoyo, mundibudze kuti ndiye yani, He, kuti ndigalemoyo muwunli?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Wawumbona, kakale ndiye iwhoyo unolebeleka nawe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Wakahandula eti, “He, Ndogalamoyo.” Akawunamata.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu wakati, “Ndakahhila tonga hango ino, kuti basingabone babone, nekuti banobona babemapofu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Bamwe bebaFarisi bakabalipedlo bakakuwha ikoku, bakati kuwunli, “Naswi bo timapofu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Katshene mamuli mapofu, mobe musina nlandu, koga sangwenu muti, ‘Tobona,’ mowhogala muna nlandu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Tjifananidzo tjeNlisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, iye usingangine mudanga lemhwizi nepankoba koga epfukila, nhu iwhoyo imbava kakale umbobola, <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />koga unongina nepankoba unlisi wemhwizi. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Nlindi wenkoba unowun'hhulila, mhwizi dzowha whi lile, kakale unodana mhwizi dzidze nemazina ekodzitungamila dzibhuda. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Hapa atjidusa dzidze dzose, unoyenda mbeli kwadzo, mhwizi dzikowuntobela, ngobe dzoziba whi lile. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Adzitotobela ntaya, koga dzowuntihha, ngobe adzitoziba whi lebataya.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Itjetji tjifananidzo Yesu wakatjihingisa kubali, koga abazotongowhisisa tjaaka eleba kubali.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Nlisi Wakanaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Ndizo Yesu wakati kubali kakale, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, ndimi nkoba wemhwizi. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bose bakahha ndisanhu ndaswika imbava nembobola, koga mhwizi adzizobawhilila. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Ndimi nkoba, hapa nhu engina nemundili, unowhotjidziwa, unowhongina akabhuda akawana mafulo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbava inohha koga kuti iwhokhwiba, nebulaya, nepaladza; imi ndakahha kuti banhu babe nebutjilo, butjilo guhhele.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Imi ndinlisi mbuya, unozwipila butjilo gugwe kuti afile mhwizi. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Unoba ali n'hingi koga asi nlisi wemhwizi, idzo mhwizi dzisidzidze, unoti ebona mhele ihha akatihha esiya mhwizi, mhele inobhata mhwizi ikadzipaladza. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Unotihha ngobe ali n'hingi koga asina hanya nemhwizi. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Imi ndinlisi mbuya, ndoziba dzangu mhwizi kakale dzangu mhwizi dzondiziba bo, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />sayikoku Tate bendiziba nami ndiziba Tate. Ndakazwimisila pila butjilo gwangu ndiyetila mhwizi. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kakale ndina dzimwe mhwizi, dzisi dzayileli danga, ndakafanila dzihhisa bo, kakale dzowhowhilila whi langu. Ndizo kowhobe netjuma tjin'ompela nenlisi un'ompela.”<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Nentha yayikoku Tate banondida, ngobe ndopila butjilo gwangu, ndikogutola kakale. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Akuna nhu unonditolela igo, koga ndozwipila kuti ndife. Ndina masimba ezwipila kuti ndife, kakale ndinamasimba ekuti nditole butjilo gwangu kakale, whoku whulayiwa kwandakayetiwa naTate bangu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kwakabe nekupalalana pakati kwemaJuta ngentha yematama iyawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bunji gwabo bakati, “Una meyambi, kakale unopenga, mowuwhilililani?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bamwe bakati, “Akuta lebeleka kwenhu unameyambi ikoku. Kuna meyambi ingapofunula bhofu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu UnoLandugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Kwaka kuli nzano weYengemadziwa kwethempeli muJerusalema, mulubaka gwembaba, <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu waka esumha nepagutukutu laSolomoni muthempeli. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ndizo maJuta akakubungana akawumbhuzwa eti, “Unowhotigadza mukusaziba kwelubaka gungapani? Hapa uli iwe Khirisitu utibhudile patjena.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Ndakamubudza kale koga amuzogalamoyo. Mihingo yandinothama muzina laTate, ibusupi gwangu, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />koga amutogalamoyo ngobe amute bamwe bemhwizi dzangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mhwizi dzangu dzowha whi langu, ndodziziba, kakale dzonditobela, <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />ndodzipa butjilo gusingapele, kakale adzitowhopalala, kakale akuna ungadzidzamula mumaboko angu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tate bangu ibo bakandipa idzo, bakulu pabamwe bose, kakale akuna unotubula kuti adzidzamule mumaboko aTate. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Imi naTate ti un'ompela.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />MaJuta akanunga mabgwe kakale kuti awunkhikitidze, <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />koga Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Ndakamulakidza mihingo yakanaka minjinji inobva kunaTate, ngono mohaka ndikhikitidzila upi wayo nemabgwe?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />MaJuta akawun'handula eti, “Atitohaka kukhikitidzila n'hingo wakanaka koga tjatinokukhikitidzila ngemabgwe whutuka Ndzimu, ngobe wati uli nhu, ukazwita Ndzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Kwakakwagwa munlayo wenyu kuyi Ndzimu wakati, ‘Mumidzimu.’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Hapa akababva eti ‘mumidzimu’ ibabo bakawamutjila dama leNdzimu, kakale lukwalo agungayi goleba manyepwa, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />moti kuna wakahagwa naTate akatumwa muhango, ‘Notuka Ndzimu,’ ngobe ndati, ‘NdiNkololo weNdzimu’? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Hapa ndisingayete mihingo yaTate bangu, musindigalemoyo, <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />koga hapa ndiyithama, nekutobe musingandigalemoyo, galanimoyo mihingo, kudze muzibe kakale muwhisise kuti Tate bamundili nami ndimuna Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Bakayedza kakale kuti bawunsunge koga wakasodzoroka mumaboko abo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu wakabgwilila seli yaJorodani, kubugalo gwaka gubvubikila Johane kutanga, akanogala ko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Banhu banjinji bakahha kuwunli, bakati, “Johane haazoyeta zwilakidzilo, koga zwinhu zose zwakalebgwa naJohane nekwenlume iwhoyu ilebeswa.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Banjinji bakagalamoyo muwunli ipapo.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lufu gwaLazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Kwaka kuna umwe nlume wekuBhethani unoyi Lazaro waka egwala, Bhethani unzi paka kugala Mariya naMaritha, hazwadzi dzidze. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Iwhoyu Mariya waka egwaligwa nehazwadzi iye Lazaro, ndiye iwhoyo wakawhohhodza He nemafuta akawumbuhika makumbo ehingisa mavudzi awe. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ndizo ke hazwadzi dzidze dzakatumila dama kunaYesu dziti, “He, iye wamunoda unogwala.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Koga Yesu wakati ekuwha akati, “Gwala ikoku akute kwelufu, ndekwegudzo leNdzimu, kuyetila kuti Nkololo weNdzimu awane gudzo ngentha yako.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Sangwenu Yesu waka eda Maritha nenun'una uwe naLazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ndizo wakati ewha kuti Lazaro unogwala, akagala mahhuba mabili pabugalo gwaaka aliko. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Hule kwayikoku wakati kubadiyiwa babe, “Ayindeni kuJudiya kakale.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Badiyiwa bakati kuwunli, “Rabhi, ngwenu zwako maJuta ayehaka mukhikitidza nemabgwe, ngono moyenda ko kakale?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Akuna ma awa gumi nemabili muhhuba? Hapa nhu eyenda masikati, haatokunhiwa, ngobe unovonekegwa netjedza tjehango ino. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Koga hapa nhu eyenda busiku, unokunhiwa, ngobe tjedza atjipo muwunli.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Wakaleba ejalo, akakoti kubali, “Nkwinya wedu Lazaro wayezela, koga ndoyenda ndinowumusa muwhope.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Badiyiwa bakati kuwunli, “He, hapa kuli kuti wayezela, unowhonaya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ipapa Yesu waka eleba nekwelufu gwaLazaro, ibo bakakumbula kuti waka eleba nekwenyaluluka akayezela. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu akabe ebabudza patjena, “Lazaro wafa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />kakale ndohanha kuti ndandisipo ndiyetila imwi, kuti mugalemoyo. Koga ayindeni kuwunli.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi, unodan'wa kuyi Phahla, wakati kubamwe bebadiyiwa, “Ayindeni bo kuti tinofa naye.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kumuka neButjilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu wakati aswika, akawana kuli kuti Lazaro waka atjibiganyiwa, atjibe nemahhuba mana ali mukumbu. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bhethani yaka ingaba makhilomitha matatu kubva muJerusalema, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />bunji gwemaJuta aka ahha kunaMaritha naMariya ewhobalekula nekwehazwadzi yabo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Maritha wakati ewha kuti Yesu unohha akayenda enowun'hanganidza, Mariya akasala mun'umba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maritha wakati kunaYesu, “He, hapa mamulipano, hazwadzi yangu yabe isingowhofa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Nangwenu ndoziba kuti keneni tjamunokumbila kuNdzimu, Ndzimu unowhomupa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Hazwadzi iyo inowhomuka kakale.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maritha wakati kuwunli, “Ndoziba kuti unowhomuka kakale pakumuka muhhuba lebupelo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Imi ndimi kumuka kubafi nebutjilo, iye unogalamoyo mundili, nekutobe akafa, unowhotjila, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />yani nayani unotjila kakale egalamoyo mundili haatowhofa kene nalini. Nokugalamoyo ikoku?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Wakati kuwunli, “Ee, He, ndogalamoyo kuti ndimwi Khirisitu, Nkololo weNdzimu, iye unowhohha muhango.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unolila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Maritha wakati aleba ikoku, akayenda enodana nun'una uwe Mariya, enyebezela eti, “Ndhiyi bapano, banokudana.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Wakati ekuwha ikoku akamilika nekulibilidza akayenda kuwunli. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Sangwenu Yesu waka asanhu akaswika kunzi, koga waka atji kubugalo gwaaka awan'wa naMaritha. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />MaJuta aka anaye mun'umba, ewunlekula, paakabona Mariya emilika nekulibilidza ebhuda, akawuntobela ekumbula kuti unoyenda kukumbu enolila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ndizo Mariya, paakaswika kwakakunaYesu wakawumbona, akapfigama pamakumbo awe, eti kuwunli, “He, hapa mamulipano hazwadzi yangu yabe isingowhofa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu wakati ewumbona elila, nemaJuta aka ahha naye elila bo, akawha zogwadza mumeya, akamanikana, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />akati, “Makawumbiganya poni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Bakati kuwunli, “He, ihhani moobona.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu wakalila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ndizo maJuta akati, “Lingani kuti wabe ewundha tjini!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Koga bamwe babo bakati, “Iwhoyu wakapofunula nlume waka elibhofu waka asingowhothama kuti nlume iwhoyu asife?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lazaro Unomusiwa Kubafi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu wakadziyidzika mumeya kakale, akaswika kukumbu, tjakatjiliguwhu, kunabgwe lakabigiwa pankoba watjo. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu wakati, “Dusani bgwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Koga Maritha, hazwadzi yemfi, wakati, “He, ndobona ngwenu weenhuwa, ngobe kwabe nemahhuba mana akafa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Andizokubudza kuti ukagalamoyo unowhobona gudzo leNdzimu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ndizo bakadusa bgwe. Yesu wakalinga pehhugwi akati, “Tate, ndomuboka kuti mandiwha. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ndandiziba kuti mogala mundiwha, koga ndaleba ikoku nentha yebanhu bamile ipapa, kudze bagalemoyo kuti makandituma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Wakati atjileba ikoku, akamimila eti, “Lazaro, bhuda.” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Mfi wakabhuda, akasungwa nematjila maboko nemakumbo, buso gugwe gwakapombegwa nejila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yesu wakati kubali, “Muwunsunungule, muwunletje ayende.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langanila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matewu 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mako 14.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ndizo bunji gwemaJuta, aka ahha naMariya akabona tjaakathama, akawunghalamoyo, <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />koga amwe abo akayenda kubaFarisi akanobabudza zwakayetiwa naYesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ndizo baphirisiti bakulu nebaFarisi bakakubunganya lubahhe, bakati, “Tithameni? Ngobe nlume iwhoyu unoyeta zwilakidzilo zwinjinji. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Tikawunletja eyendilambeli akajali, nhu wose unowhowunghalamoyo, baRoma banowhohha betipaladzila thempeli ledu netjaba tjedu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Koga umwe wabo, Khayiyafasi, waka ali mphirisiti upehhugwi gole ilelo wakati kubali, “Amuna tjamunoziba, <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />amutobona kuti kuhine kumuli kuti nhu un'ompela afile banhu, kuyetila kuti tjaba tjose tjisipalale.” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ikoku haazokuleba iye tjekukwe, koga semphirisiti upehhugwi gole ilelo waka elebesambeli kuti Yesu wakafanila fila tjaba tjemaJuta, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />kusi tjaba tjemaJuta tjoga, koga kuti akubunganye panhu pan'ompela bana beNdzimu bahhele hango yose.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ndizo kubva muhhuba ilelo bakalangana kuti bangawumbulaya tjini. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Yesu akabe asingatjayende alipatjena pakati kwemaJuta, koga wakabva ipapo akayenda kuhango ipedlo netjilambanyika, kunzi unoyi Ifureyimu, ndiko kwaakanogala nebadiyiwa babe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Sangwenu Phasika yemaJuta yakayabepedlo, banjinji bakahha kuJerusalema bebva muhangwana yose,Phasika isanhu yaswika, kuti bawhozwitjenesa. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bakabehaka Yesu, bebhuzwana umwe kuwumwe balimile muthempeli, “Mokumbulani? Kuti atowhohha kunzano?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Sangwenu baphirisiti bakulu nebaFarisi bakabalaya kuti hapa kuna unoziba kwaayako, abazibise, kudze bawunsunge.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unohhodzewa paBhethani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matewu 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mahhuba matanhatu kusanhu kwaswika Phasika, Yesu wakaswika kuBhethani, kwakabe kunaLazaro, waka amusiwa naYesu kubafi. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Bakawumbhikila tjilayilo ko, Maritha wakabapakulila zodliwa, Lazaro wakabe ali umwe webanhu bakadla naye. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariya wakatola kumbgwana tjinamafuta enadi yakwako anantengo upehhugwi kwazo akahhodza makumbo aYesu akawabuhika nemavudzi awe, n'umba yose ikahhala nhuwilila kwemafuta. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Koga Judasi Isikariyoti, umwe webadiyiwa babe (Iye wake ewhowuntengesa), wakati, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Nentha yeni mafuta iyawa asatengesewa nemakulu matatu emadinari akakopiwa bahayi?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Whoku wakakuleba, kusi kuti unahanya nebahayi koga nentha yekuti waka ali mbava, saku waka etjengeta kwama tjemari waka etongotola zwe tjakatjisiwa mukati.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu wakati, “Siyanani naye, letjani ewatjengetele hhuba lebiganyiwa kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Bahayi mogala munabo, koga imi amutowhoba nami tjoselele.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langanila Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />MaJuta manjinji akati awha kuti uyipapo, akahha, kusi ngentha yaYesu yega, koga kuti awhobona bo naLazaro, waka amusiwa kubafi. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Ndizo baphirisiti bakulu bakalangana kuti babulaye Lazaro bo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ngobe ngentha iye maJuta manjinji aka ebatihha egalamoyo munaYesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unongina muJerusalema saMambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matewu 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Hhuba linotobela bunga gulu lakalahha kunzano lakawha kuti Yesu waka ewhohha kuJerusalema. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ndizo bakatola nhabi dzemiti yemilala bakayenda benowun'hanganidza, bemimila beti, “Whosana! Wakakombolegwa iye unohha muzina laHe, Mambo weIsirayeli!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu wakawana gondolo lekakambe akagala pehhugwi kwalo, sekwakakwagwa kuti,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Usihle, nkololokadzi weZiyoni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Linga, mambo uwo unohha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">akatanha gondolo lekakambe!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Badiyiwa babe abazokuwhisisa kutanga, koga Yesu wakati atjikudziwa, bakakotjikumbula kuti ikoku kwaka kwakakwagwa nekukwe kakale kukayetiwa kuwunli.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bunga laaka analo paakadana Lazaro kuti abhude mukumbu akawumusa kubafi lakayendilambeli lipa busupi. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Tjakathama kuti mbunga webanhu uwun'hanganidze whuti banhu bakabatjiwha kuti wathama jenamiso ileli. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />BaFarisi bakati umwe kuwumwe, “Mobona kuti akuna tjamungathama, lingani, hango yose yewuntobela.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwe MaGiriki anohaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Sangwenu pakati kwebakayenda kunonamata kunzano kuJerusalema kwaka kuna maGiriki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Ndizo ibabo bakahha kunaFiliphi, waka ebva kuBhethisayida muGalile, bakati kuwunli, “He, tokumbila bona Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filiphi wakayenda akanobudza Andhireya, Andhireya naFiliphi bakayenda bakanobudza Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Lubaka gwaswika gwekuti Nkololo wenhu akudziwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, kuhhe kwekuti mhudzi yelukwehha iwile pasi mumavu ife, inowhogala ili yoga, koga ikafa, inozwala zwidlo zwinjinji. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Iye unoda butjilo gugwe gowunlahikila, iye unobenga butjilo gugwe muna ino hango unowhogutjengetela butjilo gusingapele. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Hapa kuna unondihingila, wakafanila nditobela; nepandiyapo, ipapo ndiko kunowhobe kunanlanda wangu bo; hapa kuna unondihingila, Tate banowhowunlemekedza.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unoleba nekwelufu Gugwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Sangwenu meya yangu yedziyidzika. Ngono nditini? ‘Nditi, ‘Tate, munditjidze palubaka igogu’? Aa, kungentha yayikoku ndaswika palubaka igogu. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tate, kudzani zina lenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Kukawhakala whi libva kudzimu, liti, “Ndalikudza, ndowhopamha ndikalikudza.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Bunga lakalilimile ipapo lakawha whi, bamwe mubunga bakati kwatitima, bamwe bo bakati, “Ntumwa weNdzimu walebeleka naye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Whi ileli lahhila imwi, kusi imi. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Ngwenu tongewa kwehango iyeyi kwatjiswika, sangwenu ntungamili wehango ino unotjowhoposegwa kuhhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nami, hapa ndatjimilidzigwa pehhugwi kubva muhango, ndowhokwebela banhu bose kundili.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ikoku wakakuleba elakidza lufu gwaakafanila kuti afe ndigo.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Bunga lakawun'handula liti, “Takawha munlayo kuti Khirisitu unotjila tjatjose. Ngono iwe unoti Nkololo weNhu unowhomilidzigwa pehhugwi tjini? Nkololo weNhu iwhoyu ndiyani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Tjedza tjipakati kwenyu kwelubakanyana gunotobela. Yendani mutjina tjedza, swiyo mungabva mubhakhwa nehhalima, unotjila muhhalima atoziba kwaanoyenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Hapa tjedza tjitjiyapo, galanimoyo mutjedza kuti mubebana betjedza.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Sagalamoyo kweBanhu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yesu wakati aleba ikoku, akamilika akanobabgwatila. <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nekutobe aka athama zwilakidzilo zwinjinji mbeli kwabo, koga abazowunghalamoyo, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />kuyetila kuti dama lakalebgwa nenlebesambeli Isaya lihhadzisike,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“He, ndiyani wakagalamoyo muna tjatakaleba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">kakale luboko gwaHe gwakazumbunuligwa yani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Ndizo baka basingake bakagalamoyo. Ngobe Isaya wakati kakale,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Wakata meho abo akaba mapofu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">akata mimoyo yabo ikaba mikukutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">swiyo bangabva bebona nemeho abo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">bakawhisisa nemimoyo yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">bakahandukila kundili</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">kuti ndibapolese.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya wakaleba ikoku nentha yekuti wakabona gudzo laYesu akaleba nekukwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ndizo ke, batungamili bemaJuta banjinji bakagalamoyo munaYesu; koga ngentha yebaFarisi bakabasingakulebe patjena, kuyetila kuti basitongotakhwa musinagogu, <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />ngobe bakabeda lumbidziwa nebanhu kupinda lumbidziwa neNdzimu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tonga ngematama aYesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu wakamimila eti, “Unogalamoyo mundili, haatogalamoyo mundili, koga unogalamoyo muna iye wakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Wabona imi wabona iye wakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Ndakahha ndilitjedza tjehango, kuti kene yani unogalamoyo mundili asitongogala alimuhhalima. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Hapa kuna unowha matama angu akasawatjengeta, anditowuntonga, ngobe andizobinga whotonga hango koga ndakabinga whotjidza hango. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Iye unondilamba kakale asingawamutjile matama angu, kuna unowuntonga; dama landaleba lowhobe ilo ntongi muhhuba lebupelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ngobe andizolebeleka ngemasimba angu, Tate ibo bakandituma ndibo bakandipa nlayo wezwandinoleba nezwandinoteketa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Kakale ndoziba kuti nlayo wabo butjilo gusingapele. Tjandinoleba, ndizo, ndotjileba sekwandabudziwa naTate.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unongudza Makumbo eBadiyiwa Babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Kwakati hhuba lenzano wePhasika lisanhu laswika, Yesu waka eziba kuti lubaka gugwe gwaswika gwekuti atjibva muhango ayende kunaTate, sekwaaka ada babe baka bali muhango, wakabada kuswika kubupelo.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Kwakati nelubaka gwetjilayilo, Satane paakabe atjikulonga mumoyo waJudasi Isikariyoti, nkololo waSimoni Isikariyoti kuti awuntengese, <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu, eziba kuti Tate bakawumpa masimba pehhugwi kwezwinhu zose, nekuti wakabva kuNdzimu kakale unowhobgwilila kuNdzimu, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />wakamilika patjilayilo, akambula tjimwe tjezwiyambalo tjapehhugwi akatjibiga ntome, akazwisunga munhunji nejila. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Eba esa vula mutjidla, akatangisa ngudza makumbo ebadiyiwa babe, ebabuhika nejila laaka akazwisunga nalo. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Wakaswika kunaSimoni Phethiro, Phethiro akati kuwunli, “He, mondingudza makumbo angu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Tjandinothama awutotjiziba sangwenu, koga hule kwayikoku unowhotjiwhisisa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Phethiro wakati kuwunli, “Amutowhongudza makumbo angu kene lini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Hapa ndisakungudza awuna gobe mundili.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Phethiro wakati kuwunli, “He, kusibe makumbo angu woga, koga mundingudze kose nemaboko nen'holo wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Wangula haazofanila ngula tjimwe kuhhe kwemakumbo awe, ngobe wakatjena mbili wose, namwi bo makatjena, koga kusi mose.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ngobe waka eziba kuti ndiyani unowhowuntengesa, ndizo akati, “Amuta mose makatjena.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Wakati atjibangudza makumbo, atjimbala tjiyambalo tjitje, kakale abgwilila kubugalo gugwe, wakati kubali, “Moziba kuti ndathamani kumuli? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mondidana muti Ndhiyi nekuti He, kwakatambunuka, nekuti ndiko kwandili iko. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Hapa imi, He wenyu neNdhiyi wenyu, ndamungudza makumbo, namwi bo makafanila ngudzana makumbo. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ngobe ndamulakidza, kuti namwi bo muyete sekwandayeta kumuli. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, nlanda haata pehhugwi kwabatezi babe, kene iye ntumwa haata pehhugwi kwewakawuntuma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Sangwenu meeziba zwinhu izwezwi, makakombolegwa hapa muzwithama.”<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Anditoleba nekwenyu mose, ndoziba bandakahala. Whoku ndekwekuti whalo dzihhadzisike, ‘Iye wadla tjinkwa tjangu wandihandukila.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Ndomubudza ikoku sangwenu, kusanhu kukayetika, kuti hapa koyetika mugalemoyo kuti Ndimi Iye wandili Iye. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, unowamutjila kene yani wandatuma unowamutjila imi; ne unowamutjila imi unowamutjila wakandituma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unolebesambeli nekweTengesewa kukwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matewu 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mako 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu wakati aleba ejalo, akadziyidzika mumeya, akapa busupi eti, “Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, umwe wenyu unowhonditengesa.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Badiyiwa bakalingana, basina lebeswa lekuti unoleba nekwayani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Umwe webadiyiwa babe, Yesu waaka eda, waka akanayila pafuba tjaYesu, <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />ndizo Simoni Phethiro wakawunkwenya eti, “Utibudze kuti ndiyani waanoleba nekukwe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ndizo ndhiyiwa iwhoyo wakasedzela pedlo naYesu, akawumbhuzwa eti, “He, ndiyani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Ndiye iwhoyo wandinowhopa bhemu letjinkwa hapa ndaliseba.” Wakati atjiseba bhemu letjinkwa, akaliswiswa Judasi, nkololo waSimoni Isikariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Hule kwetola bhemu letjinkwa, Satane wakangina muwunli. Yesu akati kuwunli, “Tjawunonothama, utjithame nekulibilidza.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Sangwenu akuna nhu ipapo wake eziba kuti walebelani ejalo kuwunli. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Bamwe bakabekumbula kuti, nentha yekuti Judasi waka etjengeta kwama tjemari, Yesu waka ewumbudza kuti, “Tenga zwinhu zwinohakika panzano” kene, kuti ape tjimwe tjinhu kubahayi.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ndizo, hule kwewamutjila bhemu, wakabhuda tjinyolotjo, guli busiku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nlayo Ntshwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Judasi wakati atjibhuda, Yesu akati, “Sangwenu Nkololo weNhu wekudziwa, kakale muwunli Ndzimu unokudziwa, <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />hapa Ndzimu ekudziwa muwunli, Ndzimu unowhokudza Nkololo weNhu muwunli tjekukwe, kakale unowhowunkudza tjinyolotjo. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Ngawana dzangu, ndowhobe namwi kwelubakanyana. Mowhondihaka, sekwandakaleba kubatungamili bemaJuta ngwenu ndoti kumuli, ‘Kwandinoyenda amungahhe ko.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ndomupa nlayo ntshwa, kuti mudane, sekwandakamuda, namwi bo mudane. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Banhu bose banowhoziba kuti mubadiyiwa bangu, hapa mudana.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unolebesambeli Landugwa kukwe ndiPhethiro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matewu 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Phethiro wakati kuwunli, “He, moyenda poni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu wakahandula eti, “Kwandinoyenda awunganditobele sangwenu, koga mowhonditobela hule kwelubaka.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Phethiro wakati kuwunli, “He, nentha yeni ndisingake amutobela sangwenu? Ndowhopila butjilo gwangu ndiyetila imwi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Unowhopila butjilo gugo uyetila imi? Ndolebesa, ndolebesa ndoti kukuli, gukurume lisanhu lalila, nowhoba wandilandula katatu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Izila Inoyenda kunaTate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />“Mimoyo yenyu isidziyidzike, galanimoyo muNdzimu, mugalemoyo nemundili. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Munzi waTate bangu kunan'umba njinji, hapa kwakusakajalo, ndandowhomubudza kuti ndoyenda ndinomubaakanyila bugalo? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Hapa ndatjiyenda ndinomubaakanyila bugalo, ndowhohanduka ndiwhomutola kuti mube nami, kuyetila kuti pandiyapo mubepo bo. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Kwandinoyenda zila moyiziba.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi wakati kuwunli, “He, atitoziba kwamunoyenda, zila tingayiziba tjini?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Ndizila, nelebeswa, nebutjilo; akuna unoyenda kunaTate kuhhe kwekuti ayende nemundili. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Kadzene mamundiziba, mamuwhoziba Tate bangu bo, kubva ngwenu mebaziba kakale matjibabona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filiphi wakati kuwunli, “He, mutilakidze Tate, towhogutshikana.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Ndagala nawe lubaka gulefu zwingapa, koga awutondiziba, Filiphi? Wabona imi wabona Tate, ngono unoleba tjini uti, ‘Mutilakidze Tate’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Awutogalamoyo kuti ndimuna Tate naTate bamundili? Matama andinoleba kumuli haate emasimba angu, koga Tate banogala mundili ndibo banoyeta mihingo yabo. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mundigalemoyo hapa nditi ndimuna Tate naTate bamundili, kene ke, galanimoyo mundili ngentha yemihingo tjekwayo. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, unogalamoyo mundili unowhothama mihingo yandinothama, nemihingo mikulu pana iyeyi unowhoyithama, ngobe ndoyenda kunaTate. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Kene ini tjamunokumbila muzina langu, ndowhotjithama, kuyetila kuti Tate bakudziwe muNkololo. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mukakumbila kene ini muzina langu, ndowhotjithama.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gadziwabgwe nekweMeya Yakayengemala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Hapa mundida, mowhotjengeta milayo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Ndowhotembezela kunaTate, bakamupa umwe Ntjidzi, kuti abe namwi ngekusingapele, <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />ndiye Meya yemalebeswa, usingake akawamutjigwa nehango, ngobe ayitowumbona kene iko wunziba, imwi mowunziba, ngobe unogala namwi, kakale unowhobe mumuli.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Anditowhomusiya muli sesiyan'wa, ndowhohanduka kumuli. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Kwelubakanyana, hango ayitjowhondibona, koga imwi mowhondibona, ngobe ndotjila, namwi mowhotjila bo. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Muhhuba ilelo mowhoziba kuti ndimuna Tate bangu, imwi mumundili, nami ndimumuli.”<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Unamilayo yangu kakale eyitjengeta, ndiye unondida; unondida unowhodiwa naTate bangu, nami ndowhowundha ndikazwilakidza kuwunli.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Judasi, usi Isikariyoti, wakati kuwunli, “He, kowhoyetika tjini kuti muzwilakidze kutili, koga musingazwilakidze kuhango?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Hapa nhu endida, unowhotjengeta dama langu, naTate bangu banowhowundha, kakale towhohha kuwunli tikagala naye. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Usingandide haatotjengeta matama angu. Nedama lamunowha haate langu, koga ndelaTate bakandituma.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Ndaleba zwinhu izwezwi nditjinamwi. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Koga Ntjidzi, Meya Yakayengemala, unowhotumwa naTate muzina langu, unowhomudiya zwinhu zose, akamukumbudza zwinhu zose zwandakaleba kumuli.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Ndomusiyila kunyalala, ndomupa kunyalala kwangu, anditomupa sekwamunopiwa nehango. Mimoyo yenyu isidziyidzike, kene iko kuti ibe nekuhla. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Makawha nditi kumuli, ‘Ndoyenda, koga ndowhohanduka kumuli.’ Hapa makamundida makamowhohanha, nekuti ndoyenda kunaTate, ngobe Tate bakulu pandili. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Sangwenu ndatjimubudza kusanhu kukayetika, kuyetila kuti pakunowhoyetika, mugalemoyo. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Anditjowholebeleka kwazo namwi, ngobe ntungamili wehango ino unohha. Haana masimba pehhugwi kwangu, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />koga ndoyeta sekwandakalayiwa naTate, kuyetila kuti hango izibe kuti Tate ndobada.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Milikani, ayibveni pano.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu N'hhambi Wakwako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Imi ndin'hhambi welebeswa, Tate bangu unlimi wemahhambi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Gumwe negumwe lutabi gwangu gusingazwale mitjelo, banogutema begudusa, gumwe negumwe lutabi gunozwala mitjelo banogusunulila, kuti guzwale mitjelo minjinji. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Matjitjenesewa kale nematama andaleba kumuli. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Galani mundili, nami ndigale mumuli. Sayikoku lutabi gusingake gukazwala mitjelo guli goga, kuhhe kwekuti gugale mun'hhambi, namwibo amungatubule zwala mitjelo, kuhhe kwekuti mugale mundili.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Imi ndin'hhambi, imwi munhabi. Unogala mundili, nami bo ndigala muwunli, ndiye iwhoyo unowhozwala mitjelo minjinji, ngobe kuhhe kwangu akuna tjamungathama. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Hapa nhu asingagale mundili, unolahiwa selutabi ekoswaba; nenhabi dzakajalo dzokubunganyiwa, dzikoposegwa mumoto dzipisiwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Hapa mugala mundili, nematama angu egala mumuli, kumbilani kene ini tjamunoyemula, mowhotjithamigwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nentha yayikoku Tate bangu banokudziwa, kuti mozwala mitjelo minjinji, nayiyeyo zila molakidza kuti mubadiyiwa bangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Sayikoku Tate bakandida, nami bo ndakamuda; galani muludo gwangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Hapa mutjengeta milayo yangu, mowhogala muludo gwangu, sekwandakatjengeta milayo yaTate bangu ndigala muludo gwabo.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Ndaleba zwinhu izwezwi kumuli, kuti hanha kwangu kube mumuli, nekuti hanha kwenyu kupelele. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Iwhoyu ndiwo nlayo wangu, kuti mudane sekwandakamuda imi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Akuna ludo gukulu kupinda igogu, kuti nhu apile butjilo gugwe ngentha yebakwinya babe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mubakwinya bangu hapa muthama tjandinomulaya. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Anditjamudana nditi mubalanda, ngobe nlanda atoziba kuti batezi babe banothamani; koga imi ndomudana nditi mubakwinya, ngobe kose kwandakawha naTate ndakamuzibisa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Amuzondihala, koga ndakamuhala kakale ndikamupa n'hingo wekuti muyende muzwala mitjelo nekuti mitjelo yenyu ilondolodzeke, kuyetila kuti tjamunokumbila kunaTate muzina langu, bamupe. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Iwhoyu ndiwo nlayo wangu. mudane.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubengo Gwehango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Hapa hango imubenga, zibani kuti yakabenga imi isanhu ikabenga imwi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Hapa mamuli behango, hango yayiwhomuda, koga nentha yekuti ndakamuhala ndimudusa muhango, amutjibehango, ndizo hango imuhema. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Kumbulani dama landakamubudza nditi, ‘Nlanda haata nkulu panabatezi babe.’ Hapa bedziyidza imi, banowhomudziyidza bo; hapa betjengeta dama langu banowhotjengeta lenyu bo. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Koga banowhothama zwinhu izwezwi kumuli ngentha yangu, ngobe abatoziba iye wakandituma. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Hapa ndakandisahha ndiwholebeleka nabo, banobe basina jinyo, koga sangwenu abana tjabangabgwata natjo nekwejinyo labo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Unobenga imi unobenga naTate bangu bo. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Hapa ndakandisathama mihingo isanhu ikatongoyetiwa nenhu pakati kwabo, banobe basina jinyo; koga sangwenu bakabona, bakatibenga imi naTate bangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ikoku kohhadzisa tjakakwagwa munlayo wabo kuyi, ‘Banondibengela tjisipo.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Koga hapa Ntjidzi aswika, iye wandinowhotuma kumuli ebva kunaTate, iye Meya yelebeswa, unobva kunaTate, iye unowhopa busupi nekwangu; <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />namwi bo mubasupi, ngobe makamunami kubvisila kutanga.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Ndaleba kose ikoku kumuli, kuti musiletjedze galamoyo mundili. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Banowhomutata mumasinagogu, lebeswa, lubaka gohha gwekuti unomubulaya unowhokumbula kuti unohingila Ndzimu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Banowhokuthama kose ikoku ngobe abazoziba Tate, kene imi. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Koga ndaleba zwinhu zose izwezwi kumuli, kuti hapa lubaka gwaswika mukumbule kuti ndakamubudza izo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">N'hingo weMeya Yakayengemala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Andizoleba zwinhu izwezwi kumuli kubvisila kutanga, ngobe ndakandinamwi. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Koga sangwenu ndoyenda kuna wakandituma; koga akuna umwe wenyu unondibhuzwa kuti, ‘Unoyenda poni?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Koga nentha yekuti ndaleba zwinhu izwezwi kumuli, buyendasi gwahhala mumimoyo yenyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kusineni ndomubudza lebeswa; kwakamunakila kuti ndiyende, ngobe ndikasayenda, Ntjidzi atowhohha; koga hapa ndikayenda, ndowhowuntuma kumuli. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Akahha, unowhozibisa banhu behango nekwejinyo nendulamo netongewa, <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />nekwejinyo, ngobe abatondigalamoyo; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />nekwendulamo, ngobe ndoyenda kunaTate, imwi amutjowhondibona; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />nekwetongewa, ngobe ntungamili wehango iyeyi wakatongewa.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nditjina zwinhu zwinjinji zwandinohaka leba kumuli, koga zwingamulemela kwangwenuwali. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Hapa Meya yelebeswa yatjihha, inowhomutungamilila mumalebeswa ose; ngobe ayitowholebeleka ngemasimba ayo, koga tjayinowha nditjo tjayinowholeba, kakale inowhomubudza zwinhu zwinohha. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Inowhondikudza, ngobe inowhotola kunobe kuli kwangu ikakuleba kumuli. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Kose Tate kwabanako ndekwangu; ndizo ndakati Meya inowhotola kunobe kuli kwangu ikakuleba kumuli.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyendasi neHanha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Kwelubakanyana amutjowhondibona, koga hule kwelubakanyana gunotobela mowhondibona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Bamwe bebadiyiwa babe bakabhuzwana beti, “Ini ikoku kwaanoleba kutili eti, ‘Kwelubakanyana, amutowhondibona, koga hule kwelubakanyana, mowhondibona,’ nekuti, ‘ngobe ndoyenda kuna Tate’?” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Bakati, “Unobvani hapa eti ‘kwelubakanyana’? Atitoziba kuti unobvani.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu wakaziba kuti banohaka wumbhuzwa; ndizo wakati kubali, “Mozwibhuzwa, kuti ndobvani hapa nditi, ‘Kwelubakanyana, amutowhondibona, koga hule kwelubakanyana, mowhondibona’? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, mowholila mukakuwa, koga hango inowhohanha; mowhobe nebuyendasi, koga buyendasi gwenyu gowhohanduka gukabe hanha. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Hapa nkadzimayi ali mukugwadziwa nemimba unobe nebuyendasi, nekuti lubaka gugwe gobe gwaswika; koga hapa atjitshibama, haatjakumbula gwadziwa, nentha yehanhila kuti mwana wazwagwa muhango. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ndizo muna buyendasi sangwenu, koga ndowhomubona kakale mowhohanha mumimoyo yenyu, kakale akuna unowhomutolela hanha kwenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Muhhuba ilelo akuna tjamunowhondikumbila. Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kumuli, hapa mukumbila kene ini kuna Tate, banowhomupa itjo muzina langu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Kudza kuwhoswika nasi amanhu makumbila tjimwe muzina langu; kumbilani, mowhopiwa, kuyetila kuti hanha kwenyu kuhhadzisike.”<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunda Hango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Kose ikoku ndamubudza iko nezwifananidzo; lubaka gowhohha pandisingowholebeleka namwi nezwifananidzo koga ndowhomubudza nekwaTate bangu patjena. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Muhhuba ilelo mowhokumbila muzina langu; kakale anditobva kuti ndowhomutembezelela kuna Tate, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />ngobe Tate tjekwabo banomuda, ngobe mondida kakale mogalamoyo kuti ndakabva kuna Ndzimu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Ndakabva kuna Tate ndikahha muhango; kakale, ndeesiya hango ndikayenda kuna Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Badiyiwa babe bakati, “Ehhee, ngwenu moyelebeleka patjena, kusi ngezwifananidzo! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Ngwenu teeziba kuti moziba zwinhu zose, kakale amuzofanila bhuzwiwa nenhu; nentha yayikoku togalamoyo kuti makabva kuNdzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu wakabahandula eti, “Moyegalamoyo ngwenu? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Lubaka gowhohha, nayiko gwatjiswika, pamunowhopaladziwa, umwe newumwe akayenda kanyi kukwe, mukandisiya ndoga; koga ndisindoga, ngobe Tate banami. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ndaleba ikoku kumuli, kuti muwane kunyalala mundili. Muhango mowhoba nekudziyidzika; koga hanhani; ndakunda hango.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unotembezelela Badiyiwa Babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu wakati aleba matama iyawa, akalinga kudzimu akati, “Tate, lubaka gwaswika; kudzani Nkololo wenyu kuyetila kuti Nkololo amukudze bo, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />saku makawumpa masimba pehhugwi kwebanhu bose, kuti ape butjilo gusingapele kuna bose bamakawumpa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Whogu ndigo butjilo gusingapele. Kuti bamuzibe imwi moga Ndzimu umalebeswa, naYesu Khirisitu wamakatuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Ndakamukudza muhango, n'hingo wamakandipa kuti ndiwuthame ndawumpedza; <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />sangwenu, Tate, tjindikudzani mubuyapo gwenyu negudzo landakandinalo ndinamwi hango isanhu ikabumbiwa.”<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Ndakayeta zina lenyu likazibgwa kubanhu bamakandipa ibo kubva muhango; bakabalibenyu, mukandipa ibo, dama lenyu bakalitjengeta. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Sangwenu beziba kuti zwinhu zose zwamakandipa zobva kumuli; <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />ngobe ndakabapa matama amakandipa, bakawawamutjila kakale beeziba kuti ndakabva kumuli kwelebeswa; kakale beegalamoyo kuti makandituma.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Ndobatembezelela; anditotembezelela hango, koga ndotembezelela ibabo bamakandipa, ngobe ndebenyu; <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />bangu bose ndebenyu, kakale benyu ndebangu, ndokudziwa mubali. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Sangwenu anditjipo muhango, koga ibo bamuhango, imi ndoyehha kumuli. Tate bakaYengemala, mubatjengete muzina lenyu, lamakandipa, kuti babe ban'ompela, saswi tili ban'ompela. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Pandakandinabo, ndakabatjengeta muzina lenyu, lamakandipa; ndakabalinda, akuna umwe wabo wakalahika kuhhe kwenkololo wepaladziwa, kudze lukwalo guhhadzisike. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Koga sangwenu ndoyehha kumuli; kakale zwinhu izwezwi ndozwileba ndili muhango, kudze babe nekuhanha kwangu mubali kuhhele. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Ndakabapa dama lenyu; hango ikababenga ngobe abate bemuhango, sayikoku ndisi wemuhango. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Anditotembezelela kuti mubaduse muhango, koga kuti mubadzibilile kuna kumbi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Abate bemuhango, sayikoku imi ndisi wemuhango bo. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Mubayengemadze ngelebeswa; dama lenyu lilebeswa. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Sekwamakandituma muhango, nami ndabatuma muhango. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Kakale ngentha yabo ndozwiyengemadza, kuti nayibo babe bakayengemala kwelebeswa.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Anditotembezelela ibaba boga, koga ndotembezelela nayibabo bo banogalamoyo mundili ngentha yedama labo, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />kuti babe ban'ompela bose; saku imwi, Tate, muli mundili, nami ndili mumuli, kuti nayibo babe mutili, kuyetila kuti hango igalemoyo kuti makandituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Gudzo lamakandipa ndakabapa ilo, kuyetila kuti babe ban'ompela saswi tili ban'ompela, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />imi ndilimubali namwi mulimundili, kuyetila kuti babe ban'ompela kwakapelela, kuyetila kuti hango izibe kuti makandituma nekuti makabada sekwamakandida bo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tate, ndoyemula kuti nayibo bo, bamakandipa, babe nami kwandinobe ndiliyako, kuti babone gudzo langu lamakandipa ngobe makandida hango isanhu ikabambiwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tate beNdulamo, nekutobe hango isingamuzibe, koga imi ndamuziba; nayibaba banoziba kuti makandituma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ndakabazibisa zina lenyu, kakale ndowholiyeta likazibgwa kakale, kuti ludo gwamakandida nago gube mubali, nami ndibe mubali.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Sungwa kwaYesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matewu 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu wakati apedza tembezela, akayendilambeli etjuluka nkuku weKhidironi nebadiyiwa babe, kwakabe kuna nhiba, yaakangina iye nebadiyiwa babe. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Sangwenu Judasi, iye wakawuntengesa, waka eguziba bo igogu bugalo; ngobe Yesu waka egala ehangana nebadiyiwa babe ko. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ndizo Judasi, wakatola bunga lebagwi bengwa nebamwe balindi banobva kubaphirisiti bakulu nebaFarisi, bakayenda ko bakasenga zwivoneko nezwigo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, ezibazwe kuti ini tjinowhowuwila, wakasedzela akati kubali, “Mohaka yani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bakahandula beti, “Yesu wekuNazaretha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu akabe eti kubali, “Ndimi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judasi, wakawuntengesa, waka alimile nabo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu paakati kubali, “Ndimi,” bakasedzela hule bakawila pasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Akababhuzwa kakale eti, “Mohaka yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Bakati, “Yesu wekuNazaretha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Ndamubudza kuti ndimi; ndizo, hapa muhaka imi letjani balume ibaba bayende.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Whoku kwaka kuli kwekuti kuhhadzisike dama laaka aleba eti, “Pana ibabo bamakandipa andizolahikigwa kene newun'ompela.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Kukakoti Simoni Phethiro, anabhangatjeke, wakalihomola akatema nlanda wemphirisiti upehhugwi akawunthubula zebe yekuludli. Zina lenlanda laka liyi Malikhasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu wakati kunaPhethiro, “Bgwiliza bhangatjeke lilo muwhomo; andizofanila kuti ndin'we nkombe wandapiwa naTate bangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unoyendesewa kuna Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ndizo bunga lebagwi bengwa nentungamili wabo nebalindi bemaJuta bakabhata Yesu bakawunsunga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bakatanga bawuyendesa kunaAnasi; ngobe waka ali tezwale baKhayiyafasi, iye waka alimphirisiti upehhugwi gole ilelo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kwaka kuliKhayiyafasi wakabe abudza batungamili bemaJuta kuti kuhine kuti nhu un'ompela afile banhu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phethiro Unolandula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matewu 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mako 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Phethiro wakatobela Yesu, umwe ndhiyiwa wakathama ejalo bo. Ndhiyiwa iwhoyo waka ezibgwa nemphirisiti upehhugwi, wakangina mulubahhe gwemphirisiti upehhugwi anaYesu, <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Phethiro akasala alimile kuhhe kwenkoba. Ndizo iwhoya umwe ndhiyiwa, waka ezibgwa nemphirisiti upehhugwi, wakabhuda akanolebeleka nen'hingikadzi waka alinlindi wenkoba, akanginisa Phethiro. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Iwhoyo n'hingikadzi waka alinlindi wenkoba wakati kuna Phethiro, “Awuta uli umwe webadiyiwa benlume iwhoyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Phethiro wakahandula eti, “Andita iye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Sangwenu balanda nebalindi bakabakoka masimbe, ngobe kwakakupota, baka balimile bedziya iwo, Phethiro waka alimile nabo edziya bo.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mphirisiti Upehhugwi Unobhuzwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matewu 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mphirisiti upehhugwi wakabhuzwa Yesu nekwebadiyiwa babe nezwidiyo zwizwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Ndakalebeleka patjena kuhango yose; ndogala ndidiya mumasinagogu nemuthempeli, panohangana maJuta ose; akuna tjandakaleba pakasumbikika. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Mobhuzwilani imi? Bhuzwani ibabo bakandiwha, kuti ini tjandakaleba kubali; banoziba tjandakaleba.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Wakati aleba ikoku, umwe webalindi waka alimile pedlo wakamakula Yesu, eti, “Ndiyo zila yawunohandula nayo mphirisiti upehhugwi iyeyi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Hapa ndaleba tjisakalulama, ipa busupi gwatjo; koga hapa ndaleba tjakalulama, unondilobelani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anasi wakakowumpindisila kunaKhayiyafasi mphirisiti upehhugwi, akasungwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phethiro Unolandula Yesu kakale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matewu 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mako 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Phethiro waka alimile edziya masimbe. Bakati kuwunli, “Iwe bo awuta uli umwe webadiyiwa babe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Wakalandula eti, “Andita iye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Umwe webalanda bemphirisiti upehhugwi, hama yenlume waka athubugwa zebe naPhethiro, wakabhuzwa eti, “Andizokubona munhiba unaye?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Phethiro wakalandula kakale, tjinyolotjo gukurume liba lilila.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unoyendesewa kuna Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matewu 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mako 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Bakakotjitola Yesu bebva kun'umba yaKhayiyafasi bakayenda naye kun'umba yembhati wentunhu. Kwaka kuli mangwanana, ibo tjekwabo abazotongongina mun'umba yembhati wentunhu wemaRoma, kuti basitongolongwa hambgwa, koga batubule dla phasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ndizo Pilatu wakabhudila kuhhe kubali akati, “Mowuntilika nlandu weni iwhoyu nlume?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bakawun'handula beti, “Hapa nlume iwhoyu wabe asi nthami wezwibi, tabe tisingowhowunlesi kumuli.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilatu wakati kubali, “Muwuntole imwi muyende naye munowuntonga ngekwenlayo wenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">MaJuta akati kuwunli, “Akuta panlayo kuti iswi titongele nhu kuti abulawe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Whoku kwaka kuli kwehhadzisa dama lakalebgwa naYesu elakidza lufu gwaakafanila kuti afe ndigo.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilatu wakangina mun'umba yembhati wentunhu kakale akadana Yesu, akabe eti kuwunli, “Ndiwe Mambo wemaJuta?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Unkumbulo uwo iwhoyu, kene bamwe banhu ndibo bakubudza bejalo nekwangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilatu wakahandula eti, “NdiNjhuta imi? Tjaba tjitjo nebaphirisiti bakulu ndibo bakuhhisa kundili, wathamani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu wakahandula eti, “Bumambo gwangu agute gwehango ino, hapa bumambo gwangu gwaguli gwehango ino balanda bangu babowhogwa, kuti ndisibhakhwe nemaJuta, koga bumambo gwangu agute gwemuhango.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilatu wakati kuwunli, “Ngono umambo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu wakahandula eti, “Nojalo kuti ndimambo. Ngobe ndakazwaligwa iko, ikoku ndiko kwandakahhila muhango, kuti ndipe busupi gwemalebeswa. Umwe newumwe unobe aliwelebeswa unowha whi langu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilatu wakati kuwunli, “Lebeswa ini?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu Unotongegwa Lufu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matewu 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mako 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Hule kwekusinobe aleba ikoku, wakabhudila kuhhe kumaJuta kakale, akababudza eti, “Anditowana nlandu muwunli. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Koga munanlenje wekuti ndakafanila musunungulila nsungwa un'ompela paPhasika, ndizo mungahaka kuti ndimusunungulile Mambo wemaJuta?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bakamimila kakale beti, “Kusi iye iwhoyu nlume, koga Bharabhasi!” Sangwenu Bharabhasi waka alimpanduki.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Pilatu akabe etola Yesu kuti bawunsukutile. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Bagwi bengwa bakaluka tjiyala tjemimhiwa, bakawumbadza mun'holo, bakawumbadza ngubo yembala welubende. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Bakabehha kuwunli, beti, “Ngaakudziwe, Mambo wemaJuta!” bejalo bewumadula.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilatu wakabhuda kakale, akati kubali, “Lingani, ndowundhusila kuhhe kumuli, kudze mubone kuti anditowana nlandu muwunli.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ndizo Yesu wakabhuda, akambala tjiyala tjemimhiwa nengubo yembala welumende. Pilatu akati kubali, “Lingani! whoyu nhu wenyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Baphirisiti bakulu nebalindi bakati bewumbona, bakamimila beti, “Muwunkowhomele, muwunkowhomele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilatu akabe eti kubali, “Muwuntole munowunkowhomela imwi, ngobe imi anditowuwana ananlandu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />MaJuta akawun'handula eti, “Tinawo nlayo, ngenlayo iwhoyo wakafanila kuti afe, ngobe unozwita Nkololo weNdzimu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilatu wakati ewha matama iyawa, akahla kwazo, <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />wakangina mun'umba yembhati wentunhu kakale akati kunaYesu, “Unobva poni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Koga Yesu haazohandula. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Ndizo Pilatu wakati kuwunli, “Awutohaka lebeleka nami? Awutoziba kuti ndina masimba ekukusunungula nemasimba ekukukowhomela?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu wakawun'handula eti, “Wawusingowhobe nemasimba pehhugwi kwangu hapa wawusaapiwa ebva pehhugwi, ndizo ke iwhoyo wandihhisa kukuli ndiye unajinyo gulu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Kubvila ipapo Pilatu wakatangisa haka zila yekuti awunsunungule, koga batungamili bemaJuta bakamimila beti, “Ukasunungula nlume iwhoyu, awuta nkwinya waKhesari, umwe newumwe unozwita mambo unozwigwisanya naKhesari.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilatu paakawha matama iyawo, wakadusila Yesu kuhhe akagala pasi patjigalo tjetonga pabugalo gunoyi Budzilo gweMabgwe, mutjiHhebheru tjoyi, Gabhatha. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Sangwenu kwaka kuli hhuba leBaakanyila Phasika; kwaka kuli masikati, kungabe awa yebutanhatu kubvisila bhuda kwehhuba. Wakati kumaJuta, “Lingani, whoyu Mambo wenyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Bakamimila beti, “Ngayende kutjena, ngayende kutjena, muwunkowhomele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilatu wakati kubali, “Ndikowhomele Mambo wenyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Baphirisiti bakulu bakahandula beti, “Atina umwe mambo kuhhe kwaKhesari.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Wakabaswiswa Yesu kuti bawunkowhomele.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu Unokowhomegwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matewu 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Ndizo bagwi bengwa bakatola Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />akabhuda akasenga tjileyanyo tjitje, bakayenda naye kubugalo gunoyi Pepe tjeN'holo, (mutjiHhebheru goyi Goligotha). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ndipo ipapo kwabakanowukowhomelela po, kwaka kuna bamwe babili baakakowhomegwa nabo, un'ompela ali kuludli gugwe umwe ali kulumehwe gugwe, iye Yesu elipakati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilatu wakakwala tjizibiso akatjinamatidza patjileyanyo, tjakakwagwa kuti, “Yesu wekuNazaretha, Mambo wemaJuta.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bunji gwemaJuta manjinji akabala tjizibiso itjetjo, ngobe bugalo gwakakowhomegwa Yesu gwakaguli pedlo nenzi-nkulu, kakale kwaka kwakakwagwa netjiHhebheru, netjiLathini, kose netjiGiriki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />BaPhirisiti bakulu bemaJuta bakakotjiti kuna Pilatu, “Musikwale kuti, ‘Mambo wemaJuta,’ koga kwalani kuti ‘Nlume iwhoyu wakati, NdiMambo wemaJuta.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilatu wakahandula eti, “Tjandakwala ndakwala.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Bagwi bengwa bakati bakowhomela Yesu bakapalalanya zwiyambalo zwizwe zwikabe zwikamu zwina, tjimwe netjimwe tjitogwa nengwhi; bakatola kose nengubo iye yaaka akambala. Koga ngubo iye yaka isina pakabhatshanyiwa, yakayakalukiwa kubva pehhugwi kuyenda pasi, <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />ndizo bakati umwe kuwumwe, “Ngatisiyipaluleni, koga ayikandileni malipa tibone kuti inowhobe yani.” Whoku kwakayetika kuti kuhhadzisiwe lukwalo gunoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bakakobana zwiyambalo zwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">ngubo yangu bakayikandilila malipa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ndizo ikoku kwakayetiwa nebagwi bengwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Pedlo netjileyanyo tjaYesu kwaka kulimile meyabe, namayi bakulu babe, naMariya mfumakadzi waKilopasi, naMariya wekuMagadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu wakati ebona meyabe, nendhiyiwa waanoda alimile pedlo, akati kuna mayi babe, “Mme, lingani, whoyo nkololo wenyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Wakati kundhiyiwa iwhoyo, “Linga, ibabo ndimeyabo!” Kubvila lubaka igogo ndhiyiwa iwhoyo wakabatola akanogala nabo kunzi uwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fa kwaYesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matewu 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hule kwayikoku Yesu, eziba kuti kose kwatjipela, wakati (kudze lukwalo guhhadzisike), “Ndina nyota.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Kwaka kuna nkombe waka ulihhele wayini inohababa ipapo, bakatola lungudze guhhele wayini bakagubhayila paluhanga gwehhayisopi bakasedzedza panlomo uwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu wakati an'wa wayini inohababa, akati, “Kwapela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Akakotamisa n'holo akapela meya.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unobhayiwa Palubabvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Saku laka lili hhuba leBaakanyila, kuyetila kuti basisiye mitumbi ili patjileyanyo muhhuba lesabatha (ngobe sabatha ilelo laka lili hhuba gulu kwazo), batungamili bemaJuta bakakumbila kunaPilatu kuti makumbo ebakakowhomegwa avun'we, nekuti mitumbi yabo idusiwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ndizo bagwi bengwa bakahha bakavuna makumbo ewekutanga, neewebubili waka akakowhomegwa naye, <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />koga bakati beswika kunaYesu bebona kuti watjifa kale, abazovuna makumbo awe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Koga umwe webagwi bengwa wakawumbhaya nethumo palubabvu, kukabhuda malopa nevula. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Iwhoyo wakakubona ndiye wakapa busupi-busupi gugwe gulebeswa, kakale unoziba kuti unoleba lebeswa-kudze namwi bo mugalemoyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ngobe zwinhu izwezwi zwakayetika kuti whalo dzihhadzisike. “Akuna fupa lile linowhovun'wa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kakale gumwe lukwalo goti, “Banowholinga kuwunli wabakabhaya.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiganyo waYesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matewu 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Hule kwayikoku Josefa wekuArimathiya, wakabe alindhiyiwa waYesu, koga akazwisumbika, nentha yehla batungamili bemaJuta, wakakumbila kuna Pilatu kuti atole ntumbi waYesu, Pilatu akawumbvumila. Ndizo ke wakahha akatola ntumbi waYesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodimasi bo, iye waka ahha kuwunli kutanga kuli busiku, wakahha akasenga mure yakahanganyiwa nenkonde, kuna nsindo ungaba makhilogiremu alimakumi matatu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bakatola ntumbi waYesu, bakawumpetelela nejila lelineni, bakawhuhhodza nemhoza yemure yakahanganyiwa nenkonde, senlenje webiganya kwemaJuta. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Sangwenu mubugalo gwaaka akowhomegwa kwakakuna nhiba, munhiba ipapo kwakakuna kumbu tjakatjisanhu tjikabiganyiwa nhu mutjili. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ndizo ngentha yehhuba leBaakanyila kwetjiJuta, sekumbu itjetjo tjaka tjilipedlo, bakabiganya Yesu ipapo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Kumbu Tjisina tjinhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matewu 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Sangwenu muhhuba lekutanga letshipi Mariya wekuMagadala wakayenda mangwanana kukumbu, kutjihhalima, akabona kuti bgwe latshedugwa pakumbu. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ndizo wakalabuka, akayenda kunaSimoni Phethiro nekuwumwe ndhiyiwa, iwhoyo waka ediwa naYesu, akati kubali, “Badusa He mukumbu, ngono atitoziba kuti bawumbiganya poni.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Phethiro wakabhuda newumwe ndhiyiwa, bakayenda kukumbu. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bakalabuka bose, koga whoya umwe ndhiyiwa wakalabuka akasiya Phethiro akatanga swika kukumbu; <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />wakati etumba kuti ehohhele, akabona majila elineni akabigiwa ipapo, koga haazongina mukati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Phethiro eba eswika, ewuntobela, wakangina mukumbu; akabona majila elineni eli ipapo, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />netukwi, yakayakasunga n'holo uwe, isipanhu pan'ompela ne amwe majila elineni koga yakapetewa ikabigiwa yoga. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ndizo whoya umwe ndhiyiwa waka aswika kukumbu kutanga, wakangina bo, akabona akagalamoyo; <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />ngobe mulubaka igogo bakabasanhu bakawhisisa lukwalo gunoti, wakafanila kuti amuke kubafi. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ndizo badiyiwa bakabgwilila kumizi yabo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unozwilakidza kunaMariya wekuMagadala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matewu 28.9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mako 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Koga Mariya wakama kuhhe kwekumbu elila, waka elila akahunama ehohhela mukumbu; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />wakabona batumwa beNdzimu babili bakambala zwitjena, baligele paka pabigwa ntumbi waYesu, umwe paka pabigwa n'holo umwe paka pabigwa makumbo. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Bakati kuwunli, “Mme, molilani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Wakati kubali, “Batola He wangu, ngono anditoziba kuti bawumbiganya poni.”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Wakati eleba ikoku, akatjebuka akabona Yesu alimile, koga waka asingazibe kuti ndiYesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Mme, molilani? Mohaka yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Iye wakakumbulila kuti un'hingi wenhiba, wakati kuwunli, “Tate, hapa kuli kuti mawuntola, mundibudze kuti mawumbiganya poni, ndonowhowuntola.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Mariya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Wakatjebuka akati kuwunli netjiHhebheru, “Rabhoni!” (kuleba kuti Ndhiyi).<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Musindibhate, ngobe andanhu ndikayenda pehhugwi kuna Tate, koga yendani kuhama dzangu mudzibudze kuti, nditjayenda pehhugwi kuna Tate bangu ibo bali Tate benyu bo, kuNdzimu wangu bali Ndzimu wenyu bo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariya wekuMagadala wakayenda akanobudza badiyiwa eti, “Ndawumbona He!” Wakababudza kuti waleba zwinhu izwezwi kuwunli.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Unozwilakidza kuBadiyiwa Babe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matewu 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Madekwana ehhuba ilelo, hhuba lekutanga letshipi, badiyiwa baka beli mun'umba, bakahhalila matendele, nentha yehla batungamili bemaJuta, Yesu wakahha akama pakati kwabo akati kubali, “Kunyalala ngakube kumuli.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Akati aleba ikoku, akabalakidza maboko awe nelubabvu gugwe. Badiyiwa bakahanha pabakabona He. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu wakapamha akati kubali, “Kunyalala ngakube kumuli. Saku Tate bakandituma, nami ndomutuma bo.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Wakati aleba ikoku, akabafemela eti kubali, “Wamutjilani Meya Yakayengemala. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Hapa mukayetila mazwibhatigwa matjinyo kene yani, unowhoyetigwa mazwibhatigwa; hapa mukasayetila mazwibhatigwa matjinyo kene yani, atowhoyetigwa mazwibhatigwa.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu naTomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Sangwenu Tomasi, umwe webaligumi nebabili, iye waka eyi Phahla, waka asipo pabamwe Yesu paakabuya. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ndizo bamwe badiyiwa bakawumbudza beti, “Tabona He.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Koga iye wakati kubali, “Kuhhe kwekuti ndibone mabanga embambo, ndikasa lunyala mumabanga embambo, ndikasa luboko gwangu mulubabvu gugwe, andingagalemoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Kwapinda mahhuba alihhanakadzi, badiyiwa babe baka bali mun'umba kakale, Tomasi waka alipo bo. Matendele aka akahhaligwa, koga Yesu wakahha akama pakati kwabo, akati, “Kunyalala ngakube kumuli.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Wakakotjiti kunaTomasi, “Isa lunyala gugo hapapa, ubone maboko angu, tambunudza luboko gugo, uguse mulubabvu gwangu; usibe ubvubvuma, koga galamoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi wakawun'handula eti, “He wangu naNdzimu wangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Wagalamoyo ngobe wandibona? Bakakombolegwa ibabo basakabona koga begalamoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tjinangwa Tjelukwalo Igogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu wakayeta zwimwe zwilakidzilo zwinjinji pakati kwebadiyiwa, koga zwisakakwagwa mulukwalo igogu. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Koga izwezwi zwakakwagwa kudze mugalemoyo kuti Yesu ndiye Khirisitu, Nkololo weNdzimu, nekuti hapa mugalamoyo mube nebutjilo muzina lile.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Unozwilakidza kuBadiyiwa bali Kutondeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Hule kwayikoku Yesu wakazwilakidza kakale kubadiyiwa pamhili yegungwa leThibheriyasi; wakazwilakidza sawhoku. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Phethiro, naTomasi unoyi Phahla, naNathaniyeli wekuKana kuGalile, nebakololo baZebhedi, nebamwe badiyiwa babe babili baka bali panhu pan'ompela. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Phethiro wakati kubali, “Nditjanobhata whobe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Bakati kuwunli, “Towhoyenda nawe.” Ndizo ke bakabhuda bakangina mukepe, koga busiku igogo akuna tjabakabhata. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kwakati koyedza, Yesu akama pansetje wegungwa, koga badiyiwa bakabasingazibe kuti ndiYesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Bakhwinya, muna whobe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bakawun'handula beti, “Aa.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Wakati kubali, “Poselani njanga yenyu kuludli gwekepe, mowhowana dzimwe.” Ndizo bakayiposela bakakosatubula yikakatila kuhhe, nentha yebunji gwewhobe.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ndhiyiwa iwhoya waka ediwa naYesu wakati kunaPhethiro, “NdiHe!” Simoni Phethiro wakati ewha kuti ndiHe, akambala zwiyambalo zwizwe zwapehhugwi, ngobe waka azwimbulila hinga, akatjulukila mugungwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Koga bamwe badiyiwa bakatobela belimukepe bekakata njanga ilihhele whobe, ngobe bakabasikule nemhili, koga baka bali nhambo ingaba mamitha ali gulu kubva pamhili. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Bakati beswika pamhili, bakawana moto wemasimbe ipapo, kwakahahikiwa whobe pehhugwi kwawo, netjinkwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Lesini dzimwe whobe dzamutjambobhata.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Ndizo Simoni Phethiro wakatanha kepe akanokwebela njanga kuhhe kwegungwa, ilihhele whobe whuluwhulu, dziligulu nemakumi mahanu ana whobe nhatu, nekutobe dzaka dzili njinji zwingapo, njanga yaka isapaluka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu wakati kubali, “Ihhani muwhodla zodliwa zwemangwanana.” Akuna umwe webadiyiwa wakaba netjilopa tjewumbhuzwa kuti, “Ndiwe yani?” Baka beziba kuti ndiHe. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu wakahha akatola tjinkwa akabapa, akabapa newhobe.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Whoku kwaka kwatjiba kwebutatu Yesu elakidziwa kubadiyiwa hule kwemuka kubafi.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu naPhethiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bakati bapedza dla zodliwa zwemangwanana, Yesu wakati kuna Simoni Phethiro, “Simoni, nkololo waJohane, unondida kupinda bamwe bose ibaba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Wakati kuwunli, “Ee, He; moziba kuti ndomuda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Akaba eti kuwunli, “Fudza mhwizana dzangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Gwebubili Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Simoni nkololo waJohane, unondida?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Wakahandula eti, “Ee, He; moziba kuti ndomuda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Akaba eti kuwunli, “Lisa mhwizi dzangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Wakati kuwunli gwebutatu, “Simoni nkololo waJohane, unondida?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Phethiro wakamon'wa nentha yekuti wati kuwunli gwebutatu, “Unondida?” Akati kuwunli, “He moziba zwinhu zose, moziba kuti ndomuda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Fudza mhwizi dzangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ndolebesa, ndolebesa, ndoti kukuli, pawakabe utjintjetjana, waka uzwimbalila uyenda kwawunoda, koga hapa watjikwegula, unowhotambunudza maboko awo, umwe unowhokumbadza akakusengela kwawusingayemule yenda.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Whoku wakakuleba kuti alakidze lufu gwaaka ewhokudza Ndzimu nago.) Hule kwayikoku wakati kuwunli, “Unditobele.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Newumwe Ndhiyiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Phethiro wakatjebuka akabona ndhiyiwa unodiwa naYesu ebatobela, ndiye waka abhuzwa, eti “He ndiyani unowhomutengesa?” akanayila pafuba tjaYesu pabaka bedla zodliwa zwetjilayilo. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Paakawumbona Phethiro wakati kunaYesu, “He, whoyu nlume ke?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu wakati kuwunli, “Hapa kuli kuda kwangu kuti atjile ndidze ndihanduke, kuneni nawe ikoku? Unditobele!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Iyeyi ndebo yekuti ndhiyiwa iwhoyu atowhofa yakako andama ikahhala mubanhu, koga iko Yesu asakati atowhofa, koga wakati, “Hapa kuli kuda kwangu kuti atjile ndidze ndihanduke, kuneni nawe ikoku?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ndiye iwhoyu ndhiyiwa unopa busupi gwezwinhu izwezwi, wakakwala zwinhu izwezwi, kakale toziba kuti busupi gugwe gulebeswa.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Koga kuna zwimwe zwinhu zwinjinji zwakayetiwa ndiYesu, katshene tjimwe netjimwe tjazo tjatjingakwagwa, ndokumbula kuti hango yose tjekwayo yayisingowhotubula senga whalo dzadziwhokwagwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>